ementation agents must remain separate from held-out task authorship and custody, avoid restricted payloads and answers, and obtain independent acceptance for their own changes.\",\n      \"branch\": \"main\",\n      \"origin\": \"distilled\",\n      \"author\": \"google-113003937408701635470\",\n      \"agent\": \"codex\",\n      \"effort\": \"low\",\n      \"status\": \"active\",\n      \"provenance\": [\n        {\n          \"session_id\": \"f73ff17f-fe7b-4087-bd8d-f26ad4102ad2\",\n          \"checkpoint_id\": \"01M59W4SMWH7G60B0E53VW0D22\",\n          \"transcript\": \"sessions/unknown/REDACTED.jsonl\",\n          \"line\": 3\n        },\n        {\n          \"session_id\": \"f73ff17f-fe7b-4087-bd8d-f26ad4102ad2\",\n          \"checkpoint_id\": \"01M59W4SMWH7G60B0E53VW0D22\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:50:18.135593148Z\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:50:18.135593148Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"fact:d03646b7f483da70cf518747\",\n      \"paths\": [\n        \"workflow.release.acceptance\"\n      ],\n      \"kind\": \"invariant\",\n      \"text\": \"Green CI and independent code review do not constitute qualification or release acceptance; source may merge for RC construction, but publication requires all acceptance gates and evidence tied to the actual candidate.\",\n      \"branch\": \"main\",\n      \"origin\": \"distilled\",\n      \"author\": \"google-113003937408701635470\",\n      \"agent\": \"codex\",\n      \"effort\": \"low\",\n      \"status\": \"active\",\n      \"provenance\": [\n        {\n          \"session_id\": \"f73ff17f-fe7b-4087-bd8d-f26ad4102ad2\",\n          \"checkpoint_id\": \"01M59W4SMWH7G60B0E53VW0D22\",\n          \"transcript\": \"sessions/unknown/REDACTED.jsonl\",\n          \"line\": 180\n        },\n        {\n          \"session_id\": \"f73ff17f-fe7b-4087-bd8d-f26ad4102ad2\",\n          \"checkpoint_id\": \"01M59W4SMWH7G60B0E53VW0D22\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:50:18.135593148Z\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:50:18.135593148Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"fact:816d0137a2244cdb42e8b130\",\n      \"paths\": [\n        \"workflow.testing.rules\"\n      ],\n      \"kind\": \"invariant\",\n      \"text\": \"Held-out task authorship, custody, implementation and tuning must remain separate; implementation agents may inspect aggregate metadata but must not read held-out payloads, reference patches, private validators or hidden answers.\",\n      \"branch\": \"main\",\n      \"origin\": \"distilled\",\n      \"author\": \"google-113003937408701635470\",\n      \"agent\": \"codex\",\n      \"effort\": \"low\",\n      \"status\": \"active\",\n      \"provenance\": [\n        {\n          \"session_id\": \"f73ff17f-fe7b-4087-bd8d-f26ad4102ad2\",\n          \"checkpoint_id\": \"01M59W4SMWH7G60B0E53VW0D22\",\n          \"transcript\": \"sessions/unknown/REDACTED.jsonl\",\n          \"line\": 474\n        },\n        {\n          \"session_id\": \"f73ff17f-fe7b-4087-bd8d-f26ad4102ad2\",\n          \"checkpoint_id\": \"01M59W4SMWH7G60B0E53VW0D22\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:50:18.135593148Z\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:50:18.135593148Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"fact:9e1612357fb027df7b108931\",\n      \"paths\": [\n        \"workflow.acceptance.independence\"\n      ],\n      \"kind\": \"invariant\",\n      \"text\": \"Implementation agents must not inspect held-out payloads, reference patches, private validators, or hidden answers, and cannot independently accept their own changes; qualification authorship and custody must remain separate from implementation and tuning.\",\n      \"branch\": \"main\",\n      \"origin\": \"distilled\",\n      \"author\": \"google-113003937408701635470\",\n      \"agent\": \"codex\",\n      \"effort\": \"low\",\n      \"status\": \"active\",\n      \"provenance\": [\n        {\n          \"session_id\": \"f73ff17f-fe7b-4087-bd8d-f26ad4102ad2\",\n          \"checkpoint_id\": \"01M59W4SMWH7G60B0E53VW0D22\",\n          \"transcript\": \"sessions/unknown/REDACTED.jsonl\",\n          \"line\": 3\n        },\n        {\n          \"session_id\": \"f73ff17f-fe7b-4087-bd8d-f26ad4102ad2\",\n          \"checkpoint_id\": \"01M59W4SMWH7G60B0E53VW0D22\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:43:47.162972762Z\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:43:47.162972762Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"fact:f979f678edf3ac924da1d977\",\n      \"paths\": [\n        \"workflow.testing.rules\"\n      ],\n      \"kind\": \"convention\",\n      \"text\": \"Evaluate standalone Nexus and optional gateway integration separately, distinguish scripted validation from live local-model acceptance, and explicitly report unmet requirements; a green suite alone does not establish acceptance.\",\n      \"branch\": \"main\",\n      \"origin\": \"distilled\",\n      \"author\": \"google-113003937408701635470\",\n      \"agent\": \"codex\",\n      \"effort\": \"low\",\n      \"status\": \"active\",\n      \"provenance\": [\n        {\n          \"session_id\": \"5854e03a-1246-49e8-b2c2-790021904850\",\n          \"checkpoint_id\": \"01M4WVWHG7TDD06EETCV3DSCT7\",\n          \"transcript\": \"sessions/unknown/REDACTED.jsonl\",\n          \"line\": 1\n        },\n        {\n          \"session_id\": \"5854e03a-1246-49e8-b2c2-790021904850\",\n          \"checkpoint_id\": \"01M4WVWHG7TDD06EETCV3DSCT7\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:43:47.162972762Z\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:43:47.162972762Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"fact:1da908242317349634490e0a\",\n      \"paths\": [\n        \"workflow.review.rules\"\n      ],\n      \"kind\": \"invariant\",\n      \"locus\": [\n        \"v1.0.0\"\n      ],\n      \"text\": \"For v1.0.0 release work, agents must never self-accept; merging their own PRs requires independent ACCEPT and green CI on the exact head, and requirements --enforce must be rerun at new integration heads.\",\n      \"branch\": \"main\",\n      \"origin\": \"distilled\",\n      \"author\": \"google-113003937408701635470\",\n      \"agent\": \"codex\",\n      \"effort\": \"low\",\n      \"status\": \"active\",\n      \"provenance\": [\n        {\n          \"session_id\": \"90831ce7-12dd-4e3f-a07d-bc2921efe403\",\n          \"checkpoint_id\": \"01M5ZZTDS74T864B7F1GCVGKCK\",\n          \"transcript\": \"sessions/unknown/REDACTED.jsonl\",\n          \"line\": 1184\n        },\n        {\n          \"session_id\": \"90831ce7-12dd-4e3f-a07d-bc2921efe403\",\n          \"checkpoint_id\": \"01M5ZZTDS74T864B7F1GCVGKCK\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:43:47.162972762Z\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:43:47.162972762Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"fact:31acf9d2764c3acd6608ce40\",\n      \"paths\": [\n        \"project.tooling.stack\"\n      ],\n      \"kind\": \"closed-negative\",\n      \"locus\": [\n        \"beta.10-to-beta.18\"\n      ],\n      \"text\": \"PR #38 was closed because v1 integration already contained the sharp 0.35.5 security fix, while its bundled Cloudflare cf beta.10-to-beta.18 upgrade was unnecessary and untested in v1; revisit cf through a fresh post-release Dependabot PR or PLAN-C1 hardening.\",\n      \"branch\": \"main\",\n      \"origin\": \"distilled\",\n      \"author\": \"google-113003937408701635470\",\n      \"agent\": \"codex\",\n      \"effort\": \"low\",\n      \"status\": \"active\",\n      \"provenance\": [\n        {\n          \"session_id\": \"90831ce7-12dd-4e3f-a07d-bc2921efe403\",\n          \"checkpoint_id\": \"01M5ZZTDS74T864B7F1GCVGKCK\",\n          \"transcript\": \"sessions/unknown/REDACTED.jsonl\",\n          \"line\": 403\n        },\n        {\n          \"session_id\": \"90831ce7-12dd-4e3f-a07d-bc2921efe403\",\n          \"checkpoint_id\": \"01M5ZZTDS74T864B7F1GCVGKCK\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:43:47.162972762Z\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:43:47.162972762Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"fact:db2c60684166bcd2018f32c3\",\n      \"paths\": [\n        \"workflow.testing.rules\"\n      ],\n      \"kind\": \"invariant\",\n      \"text\": \"Release-candidate validation must cover the exact source commit being tagged; any integration-head change, including a docs-only merge, requires fresh source CI and a new requirements --enforce run.\",\n      \"branch\": \"main\",\n      \"origin\": \"distilled\",\n      \"author\": \"google-113003937408701635470\",\n      \"agent\": \"codex\",\n      \"effort\": \"low\",\n      \"status\": \"active\",\n      \"provenance\": [\n        {\n          \"session_id\": \"90831ce7-12dd-4e3f-a07d-bc2921efe403\",\n          \"checkpoint_id\": \"01M5ZZTDS74T864B7F1GCVGKCK\",\n          \"transcript\": \"sessions/unknown/REDACTED.jsonl\",\n          \"line\": 627\n        },\n        {\n          \"session_id\": \"90831ce7-12dd-4e3f-a07d-bc2921efe403\",\n          \"checkpoint_id\": \"01M5ZZTDS74T864B7F1GCVGKCK\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:43:47.162972762Z\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:43:47.162972762Z\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"query\": \"Nexus v1 release gates: exact RC acceptance, held-out custody, manual terminal matrix, and current integration requirements\",\n  \"retrieval_engine\": {\n    \"schema_version\": 1,\n    \"effective_engine\": \"bm25_lexical\",\n    \"identity_verified\": true,\n    \"semantic_requested\": false,\n    \"semantic_applied\": false,\n    \"semantic_available\": false,\n    \"bm25_enabled\": true,\n    \"bm25_applied\": true,\n    \"fallback_used\": false\n  }\n}\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1828e-5af5-7fb1-bc6f-34b2f291d340","create_time":1793193769.430561}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
