{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T13:23:20.738Z","ordinal":457307,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a1828e-5af5-7fb1-bc6f-34b2f291d340","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-5a703b81-9361-4c9f-9dc5-dccef88bf3ed","process_id":"63497","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","for p in 299 300 302 305; do gh pr view \"$p\" --json number,reviews,comments,commits; done"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"for p in 299 300 302 305; do gh pr view \"$p\" --json number,reviews,comments,commits; done"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"{\"comments\":[{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABgTPoCw\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"coderabbitai\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"NONE\",\"body\":\"<!-- coderabbit-ai-generated:v1 -->\\n\\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: summarize by coderabbit.ai -->\\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: skip review by coderabbit.ai -->\\n\\n> [!IMPORTANT]\\n> - [ ] <!-- {\\\"checkboxId\\\":\\\"e9bb8d72-00e8-4f67-9cb2-caf3b22574fe\\\"} --> 🔍 Trigger review\\n> \\n> This repository does not receive automatic reviews because it has fewer than 10 stars.\\n> \\n> <details>\\n> <summary><strong><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/cog-dark.svg\\\"><img src=\\\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/cog.svg\\\" width=\\\"16\\\" height=\\\"16\\\" align=\\\"absmiddle\\\" alt=\\\"\\\"></picture> Run configuration</strong></summary>\\n> <dl>\\n> <dd>\\n> \\n> - **Source mode**: Auto\\n> - **Repository**: Unavailable\\n> - **Branch**: Unavailable\\n> - **File**: No configuration file from this repository applied\\n> - **Commit**: Unavailable\\n> - **Layers**: defaults\\n> - **Review profile**: CHILL\\n> - **Plan**: Advanced\\n> - **Run ID**: `8985e1f1-861a-494a-87ca-f