 explicit restart recreates a clean worktree while resuming the old agent conversation. That behavior must be fixed and requalified before an RC built from this main can be accepted.\n \n-**Source PRs:** PR [#303](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/303) is integrated at `4cac22d`; its exact-head required CI and independent review passed. PR [#304](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/304) is integrated at `b2ae2fe`; its exact-head Node 22/24, Linux, CodeQL and JS/TS checks passed and Entire Gates concluded neutral. Its independent review nevertheless found the restart/conversation defect above. PR [#305](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/305) addresses that defect at `f7e573ec8de98fb3ec24a96e148a84b4ccab151f`, with independent review ACCEPT at diff SHA-256 `cf1abd6ce5e7083aebe526efaaee85380dee295fced7814a7ddedcd609a11615`. Build and focused test TypeScript check passed; the runtime test was not run locally because `SUITE` is actively claimed by `kimi-main`. Exact-head Node 22/24 and Entire checks are in progress; JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL passed. PR [#299](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/299) still points remotely at `0f54f5395d9ceb87eb1e6d9fafc1f4d728675e9a` on base `4cac22d`. Its local rebased candidate on `b2ae2fe` is `004234de6d8599d71083b4f686c1bdbffe21dd2f`; diff-check passes, and fresh independent review plus exact-head CI are pending. Issue [#298](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/298) remains open until its fix is integrated and current-main checks pass. PR [#300](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/300) still points remotely at stale head `5d2932f0a90516343c52bb36531a93f29aa921cd` on base `b293b44`; its exact-head source checks passed, but Entire Gates **failed** at 12:56:04 UTC and the gate needs disposition before merge. Its local readiness candidate is being refreshed against `b2ae2fe`. PR [#302](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/302) has since 