{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T13:50:00.496Z","ordinal":458497,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a182b5-7df6-71b2-a955-13339511caaf","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0db389702a7164cc016ae1fd873d5c819f847def9af6ad2f94","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The PR #305 failures are now reproducibly fixed in the focused checks: all six recovery variants and the explicit-restart TDD test passed when run serially with the project’s isolated-home setup. The first filtered invocation ran selected tests concurrently and produced a fixture-only failure; the serialized rerun passed 7/7. Separately, I found additional uncommitted PR #302 bare-repository handling in the shared worktree with no corresponding claim or available Agent Mail identity. I’m preserving it and recording that ownership gap rather than overwriting it."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793195399261,"completed_at_ms":1793195400496}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T13:50:00.499Z","ordinal":458498,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","status":"completed","id":"msg_0db389702a7164cc016ae1fd873d5c819f847def9af6ad2f94","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"The PR #305 failures are now reproducibly fixed in the focused checks: all six recovery variants and the explicit-restart TDD test passed when run serially with the project’s isolated-home setup. The first filtered invocation ran selected tests concurrently and produced a fixture-only failure; the serialized rerun passed 7/7. Separately, I found additional uncommitted PR #302 bare-repository handling in the shared worktree with no corresponding claim or available Agent Mail identity. I’m preserving it and recording that ownership gap rather than overwriting it.","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a182b5-7df6-71b2-a955-13339511caaf","create_time":1793195399.2418692,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_0db389702a7164cc016ae1fd873d5c819f847def9af6ad2f94","turn_id":"01a182b5-7df6-71b2-a955-13339511caaf","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a182c6-5d33-7133-8076-8854d8aa8fce","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":21845}}
