{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T14:06:21.673Z","ordinal":459244,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a182b5-7df6-71b2-a955-13339511caaf","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0db389702a7164cc016ae2015ba6b8819f853a43c7ebcde223","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"I followed the `using-entire` workflow: `entire status` and the repo brief worked. Entire search could not authenticate because `org.freedesktop.secrets` is unavailable; the Brain status check also reports unsafe freshness because the shared checkout is dirty. I left that checkout untouched.\n\nThe current base is still `origin/main` **b2ae2fe**. Independent review is confirmed as **ACCEPT** for PRs #299, #300, #302, and #305 on their exact heads, and I recorded those dispositions in the owned claim records. Their required CI is still running, so I did not merge them. PR #299’s Linux packaging job has been in progress since 13:42 UTC; logs are unavailable while it runs.\n\nThe latest published release remains RC10. Held-out custody is still unresolved, and there is no stable v1.0.0 release. **Campaign: active. Acceptance: IN_PROGRESS.** No source changes were made."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1793196379676,"completed_at_ms":1793196381673}}
