{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T14:06:30.078Z","ordinal":459248,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"task_complete","root_turn_id":"01a182b5-7df6-71b2-a955-13339511caaf","turn_id":"01a182b5-7df6-71b2-a955-13339511caaf","last_agent_message":"I followed the `using-entire` workflow: `entire status` and the repo brief worked. Entire search could not authenticate because `org.freedesktop.secrets` is unavailable; the Brain status check also reports unsafe freshness because the shared checkout is dirty. I left that checkout untouched.\n\nThe current base is still `origin/main` **b2ae2fe**. Independent review is confirmed as **ACCEPT** for PRs #299, #300, #302, and #305 on their exact heads, and I recorded those dispositions in the owned claim records. Their required CI is still running, so I did not merge them. PR #299’s Linux packaging job has been in progress since 13:42 UTC; logs are unavailable while it runs.\n\nThe latest published release remains RC10. Held-out custody is still unresolved, and there is no stable v1.0.0 release. **Campaign: active. Acceptance: IN_PROGRESS.** No source changes were made.","started_at":1793194294,"completed_at":1793196390,"duration_ms":2095268,"time_to_first_token_ms":4014}}
