{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T14:07:48.457Z","ordinal":459293,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a182d5-76db-7c32-855f-8a7a037c7e55","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-8d609dc4-a577-4606-9428-4552c39bbb72","process_id":"64476","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","entire trail --help && entire trail approve --help"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"entire trail --help && entire trail approve --help"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"A trail captures project intent across repositories and branches. Manage intent and discussions on the whole trail; use --repo and --branch to select context for checkout, sessions, findings, and approvals.\n\nUsage:\n  entire trail [flags]\n  entire trail [command]\n\nAvailable Commands:\n  approvals       List approval decisions on a trail\n  approve         Approve a trail\n  checkout        Check out a trail's branch\n  comment         Discuss the whole trail across repositories\n  create          Create a trail and publish its branch\n  finding         Manage a trail's agent findings\n  link            Link a repository branch to a trail\n  list            List trails in a project\n  merge           Merge one of a trail's changes into its base\n  resume          Resume a trail's agent session\n  show            Show trail intent and its repositories and branches\n  unlink          Unlink a repository branch without deleting its work\n  update          Update project intent and lifecycle\n  watch           Tail events for a trail's selected repository branch\n\nFlags:\n  -h, --help             help for trail\n      --project string   Project as gh/<owner> or et/<project>; required for list, otherwise defaults to the repository's namespace\n      --repo string      Target repository as forge/owner/repo (e.g. gh/acme/app) or a clone URL; for list, only filters the required --project\n\nGlobal Flags:\n      --context name   Act as this saved login name for this command only — including the git and agent processes it spawns — instead of the active context (entire auth contexts lists them)\n\nUse \"entire trail [command] --help\" for more information about a command.\nApprove a trail.\n\n<trail> is a project trail number, ID, or <repo>/<number>. Without one, follow the current branch's\nparent. --repo and --branch select a working context. Only that branch is approved,\nnot every repository on the trail. The branch work must be open.\n\nUsage:\n  entire trail approve [<trail>] [flags]\n\nFlags:\n      --branch string    Select a repository branch within the trail\n  -h, --help             help for approve\n  -m, --message string   Optional approval comment\n\nGlobal Flags:\n      --context name     Act as this saved login name for this command only — including the git and agent processes it spawns — instead of the active context (entire auth contexts lists them)\n      --project string   Project as gh/<owner> or et/<project>; required for list, otherwise defaults to the repository's namespace\n      --repo string      Target repository as forge/owner/repo (e.g. gh/acme/app) or a clone URL; for list, only filters the required --project\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":52202379}},"started_at_ms":1793196468404,"completed_at_ms":1793196468457}}
