{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T14:08:37.700Z","ordinal":459325,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a182d7-6943-7350-bcf6-6ea5d0d98a5c","author":"/root/review_pr302","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/review_pr302\nPayload:\nConfirmed the current PR heads, common base, and cumulative diff SHA-256 values. My earlier **ACCEPT** reviews cover each exact head:\n\n- #299 `004234de…` — `55afcdc8ed8044bb0aa0a54932c5ba6513763b564bc8fb76014b3334db33ae38`\n- #300 `11dc196f…` — `2ab25de0645cb96bc4f874f35e4f327817f93a29216c12ef463ad380192b6513`\n- #302 `3c52580a…` — `d90aeb05a9f5c5d0a35bfa0f597d96cc39a5f6480e22b20094f7523cd4cacdff`\n- #305 `97f1c6ea…` — `5a09bdcf43f81f03e98f3fc368fdcbc388330eedeb11a0ae13e46e9d001132ec`\n\nI could not approve the trails. `entire auth status` reports **Not logged in to `us.auth.entire.io`**; listing trails fails because the access token cannot be loaded: `The name org.freedesktop.secrets was not provided by any .service files`. I did not attempt approval or use another identity. An authorized independent reviewer with a working Entire login must handle approval; this session could not determine whether its reviewer identity otherwise has approval authority."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a182d5-76db-7c32-855f-8a7a037c7e55","create_time":1793196517.6997702,"content_item_metadata":[{"provenance":{"type":"tool","namespace":"collaboration"}}]}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":21882}}
