 runner split into execution/revalidation/persistence/diagnostics; DecisionRejected semantics documented; generated deterministic scheduler properties and end-to-end convergence integration tests exist; operator config supports ~/.config/nexus/config.json and environment overrides. PR273 runtime identity fix and PR289/PR296 operation work are ancestors of main, but none of those later commits is in RC10. Confirm next RC includes them; no new implementation started because these gaps are already addressed on main.\",\n  acceptance:\"IN_PROGRESS; no accepted RC or stable v1.0.0 publication.\"\n }\n});\ntext(JSON.stringify({time:t.current_time,result:r}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a182d5-76db-7c32-855f-8a7a037c7e55","create_time":1793197017.0619335}}}
