{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T14:31:54.800Z","ordinal":459997,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a182e6-a694-79c3-bee4-8efcb06d6e41","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0db389702a7164cc016ae207596970819f8ff5c529fb96ad69","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"I posted exact-head status updates on PRs #299, #300, #302, and #305, and refreshed the held-out status request. The dirty shared checkout remains untouched.\n\nPR #305’s Linux job has advanced through tests and the first package build to the reproducibility package build. PR #302’s Linux test suite remains active. Both have passing Node 22/24, JS/TS, and CodeQL checks. PRs #299 and #300 still have failed Entire approval gates; #302 still reports five unresolved high-severity Entire findings. No merge is safe yet.\n\nThe request for an authenticated independent Entire reviewer and the held-out custodian response are still pending. **Campaign active; acceptance IN_PROGRESS.**"}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1793197913455,"completed_at_ms":1793197914800}}
