cation.\",\n      \"branch\": \"main\",\n      \"origin\": \"distilled\",\n      \"author\": \"google-113003937408701635470\",\n      \"agent\": \"codex\",\n      \"effort\": \"low\",\n      \"status\": \"active\",\n      \"provenance\": [\n        {\n          \"session_id\": \"90831ce7-12dd-4e3f-a07d-bc2921efe403\",\n          \"checkpoint_id\": \"01M5ZZTDS74T864B7F1GCVGKCK\",\n          \"transcript\": \"sessions/unknown/REDACTED.jsonl\",\n          \"line\": 902\n        },\n        {\n          \"session_id\": \"90831ce7-12dd-4e3f-a07d-bc2921efe403\",\n          \"checkpoint_id\": \"01M5ZZTDS74T864B7F1GCVGKCK\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:43:47.162972762Z\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:43:47.162972762Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"fact:3b241bd2f4fd79c4eef73a6b\",\n      \"paths\": [\n        \"workflow.testing.rules\"\n      ],\n      \"kind\": \"invariant\",\n      \"text\": \"Qualification evidence must verify the installed RC’s actual payload; a configured package digest or hash of a release-invariant launcher cannot establish build identity.\",\n      \"branch\": \"main\",\n      \"origin\": \"distilled\",\n      \"author\": \"google-113003937408701635470\",\n      \"agent\": \"codex\",\n      \"effort\": \"low\",\n      \"status\": \"active\",\n      \"provenance\": [\n        {\n          \"session_id\": \"b79a4439-e6ad-4986-aa16-4a81f838ac71\",\n          \"checkpoint_id\": \"01M568DWD19TM18BY3E38JSGVC\",\n          \"transcript\": \"sessions/unknown/REDACTED.jsonl\",\n          \"line\": 510\n        },\n        {\n          \"session_id\": \"b79a4439-e6ad-4986-aa16-4a81f838ac71\",\n          \"checkpoint_id\": \"01M568DWD19TM18BY3E38JSGVC\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:43:47.162972762Z\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:43:47.162972762Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"fact:8a594d0e92c29b347b3994b9\",\n      \"paths\": [\n        \"architecture.routing.evaluation\"\n      ],\n      \"kind\": \"closed-negative\",\n      \"locus\": [\n        \"deep-planner/lead-coder\"\n      ],\n      \"text\": \"The frozen 11-task comparison did not establish a benefit for first-turn-heavy deep-planner/lead-coder routing: B1 passed 7/11, B2 passed 6/11, exact paired sign-test p=1.0, and B2 took about 21% longer; preserve this bounded finding and revisit only with a larger corpus and a substantive hypothesis about which tasks need deeper planning.\",\n      \"branch\": \"main\",\n      \"origin\": \"distilled\",\n      \"author\": \"google-113003937408701635470\",\n      \"agent\": \"codex\",\n      \"effort\": \"low\",\n      \"status\": \"active\",\n      \"provenance\": [\n        {\n          \"session_id\": \"5e99063d-042c-4962-9221-1650fa0f4489\",\n          \"checkpoint_id\": \"01M41G6TDNTMPXWBKWES1FXNX9\",\n          \"transcript\": \"sessions/unknown/REDACTED.jsonl\",\n          \"line\": 640\n        },\n        {\n          \"session_id\": \"5e99063d-042c-4962-9221-1650fa0f4489\",\n          \"checkpoint_id\": \"01M41G6TDNTMPXWBKWES1FXNX9\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:43:47.162972762Z\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:43:47.162972762Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"fact:1b54f28e98d5720d87a63c30\",\n      \"paths\": [\n        \"workflow.testing.rules\"\n      ],\n      \"kind\": \"closed-negative\",\n      \"locus\": [\n        \"crash/resume\"\n      ],\n      \"text\": \"The context-convergence branch at 31d6622 was not accepted: its only real acceptance run failed at step 119 without an artifact after repeated long-write timeouts, and an isolated reproduction exposed findings loss and ID reuse after crash/resume; revisit acceptance after fixing recovery and persistence and completing a fact-checked artifact-producing rerun.\",\n      \"branch\": \"main\",\n      \"origin\": \"distilled\",\n      \"author\": \"google-113003937408701635470\",\n      \"agent\": \"codex\",\n      \"effort\": 