copy gives way to its full finding (96.674232ms)\n  ✔ while findings exceed their bound, the first output of each step says so with the step position; recording ignores it (539.367005ms)\n  ✔ in the last fifth of the step budget the first output of each step says how many remain and asks to finish, leaving room for validation; recording ignores it (114.774405ms)\n  ✔ a new request does not inherit the memory notice: it returns only once that request's own compaction finds findings over their bound (2090.436719ms)\n  ✔ step notices speak only for the turn that issued them: a follow-up or retried turn does not see an earlier turn's (3749.757467ms)\n  ✔ the whole memory is bounded: past its budget the oldest commands, then removal notes, give way, so the record stays flat (188.661108ms)\n[context_findings] step=2 observations=12 recorded=yes chars=30\n{\n  \"agent\": \"codex-root\",\n  \"branch\": \"v1/checkpoint-ordinary-child-fix\",\n  \"head\": \"3c52580ae1da6b7f1282018f4d3702dcb75f8bd7\",\n  \"since\": \"2026-10-28T14:40:34Z\",\n  \"worktree\": \"/var/tmp/nexus-pr302-build-test.0Aaskz/source\",\n  \"scope\": \"PR302 patched exact-head snapshot; isolated make build then full make test; no live gateway inference\"\n}\n2026-10-28T14:38:04Z PR302_FULL_SUITE_FAILURES_PROVISIONAL new_test=CLI_nexus_upgrade_command_execution_and_exit_codes; suite_live_pid=3466911 classify_from_final_assertion\n2026-10-28T14:39:06Z PR302_LOCAL_SUITE_CLASSIFICATION build_prerequisite=UNSATISFIED make_test_invoked_without_make_build snapshot_cli_dist_absent=1 evidence=write_build_info_ENOENT_and_cli_test_upgrade_uses_dist/index.js; treat_these_failures_as_invocation/prerequisite_not_product_until_correct_build_then_test_run; other_eval_failures_unclassified\n2026-10-28T14:39:55Z PR302_EXACT_HEAD_MAKE_TEST head=3c52580ae1da6b7f1282018f4d3702dcb75f8bd7 exit=2 logs=/var/tmp/nexus-pr302-make-test.WqROxd\n2026-10-28T14:40:34Z CLAIM SUITE PR302 patched snapshot make build+full make test head=3c525