{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T15:01:49.448Z","ordinal":460976,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"task_complete","root_turn_id":"01a182ff-7fdf-75f3-91ed-c84b8c837a5f","turn_id":"01a182ff-7fdf-75f3-91ed-c84b8c837a5f","last_agent_message":"**Convergence remains active; acceptance is `IN_PROGRESS`.** I verified the PR #302 build-and-test process is still live: its log advanced to 579,737 bytes at 15:01 UTC, and the SUITE claim remains active. This run uses the PR #302 base plus an uncommitted patch, so it is supplemental evidence, not an exact-head result.\n\nWhile it runs, I completed `git diff --check` and `node --check` on the separate clean-checkout build-identity fix. Its regression test is queued until SUITE ownership clears. I recorded both updates in the existing work record and left the dirty shared checkout untouched.\n\nThe published RC is still RC10. PRs #299, #300, #302 and #305 remain blocked by failed Entire gates; PR #302’s five high-severity findings still need an authenticated independent reviewer to inspect and disposition them. Held-out custody and final-RC manual terminal evidence also remain outstanding.","started_at":1793199144,"completed_at":1793199709,"duration_ms":564511,"time_to_first_token_ms":2140}}
