{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T15:25:05.915Z","ordinal":461541,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a18308-1d0e-7bd3-85ce-e8dc498ce52f","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-1328fbcf-e0a0-45c5-8afd-3c37449ea5ac","server":"mcp-search","tool":"work_state_read","arguments":{"includeClosed":true},"pluginId":"claude-mem@claude-mem-local","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"- nexus-operation-review-findings-20261028: detail=Checkpoint 2026-10-28 13:35:27 UTC. Corrected PR #300 readiness record after independent reviewer CHANGES_REQUIRED on 484cfbf. PR #300 head 96cc7dcb3235ef8d12f7e12025dd24e8e4ef92b5, base b2ae2fe, cumulative diff SHA 01418bd9d9b39f5de0c98eb513d3b627525e4dfa149cdf03109a5dba12ddedbf; docs diff-check PASS; exact-head CI active, independent factual re-review requested. Main CI 40693030763 exact b2ae: Node22/24 PASS, Linux active. PR299 004234de: Node22/24 active, CodeQL/JS-TS pass, Entire pending. PR302 659d6a6: Node22/24, CodeQL/JS-TS pass, Linux active, Entire pending; fresh review pending. PR305 f7e573e: Node22 and Node24 both fail, each 1882 pass/2 fail/2 skip; durable_continuity.test.ts fails expected explicit-restart recovery warning; tdd_work_units.test.ts fake agent lacks restartConversation; Linux skipped. No merged integration/RC; acceptance IN_PROGRESS, issue #1 has no custodian reply and terminal matrix 0/15., checkpoint_time_utc=2026-10-28T14:34:00Z, checkpoint_summary=Live refresh: origin/main b2ae2fe82640e44d58ef5418f49b46df03392212; latest release RC10. PR299 full CI passes but Entire trail14 FAILED because no reviewer approved. PR300 full CI passes but Entire trail15 FAILED for same missing approval. PR302 Node24/JS/TS/CodeQL pass, Node22 running; Entire reports five unresolved high findings plus no approval. PR305 Node22/24/JS/TS/CodeQL pass; Linux and Entire active. Independent reviewer ACCEPT covers exact heads, but reviewer cannot access Entire due unavailable auth/keyring. Held-out issue #1 remains open and unassigned; no custodian reply since 12:42 UTC., current_action=Poll the existing suite until final summary and claim release. Then run the focused build-identity regression in its isolated branch. Entire reviewer approvals/findings and held-out custody remain separate release blockers., entire_status=Entire local brain brief completed and supplied release invariants. Semantic/history checkpoint search via entire search and recap remains unavailable: login token cannot load from missing org.freedesktop.secrets. Brain status reports dirty/unindexed shared worktree; no repair attempted., latest_progress=At 2026-10-28 15:21 UTC, independent source review ACCEPT is recorded for build-identity patch (diff SHA c0c7b8be14de2cf1aab3246b2f34596ba4aae30c2d527c1afbe93e1ce0105295), no tests in review. PR302 patched snapshot build+full make test process PID 3669407 is still active with SUITE claim, log mtime 15:21:39Z at 1,007,171 bytes; latest tests in upgrade crash recovery passed. No terminal summary yet., blocker=PR299/300/302/305 remain blocked by Entire reviewer approval; PR302 also has five unresolved high findings. The account context is stored but unusable in this headless session due missing keyring service. Held-out custodian remains unresponsive; final RC and terminal matrix pending., release_state=origin/main=b2ae2fe82640e44d58ef5418f49b46df03392212; latest prerelease=RC10; no accepted RC or stable v1.0.0; acceptance IN_PROGRESS., acceptance=IN_PROGRESS; no accepted RC or stable v1.0.0 release., added_scope_review=On origin/main, the user-listed codebase gaps are already substantially addressed: capabilities split by category; scheduler extracted; runner split into execution/revalidation/persistence/diagnostics; DecisionRejected behavior documented; generated scheduler invariants and convergence integration tests exist; operator config is supported. Relevant PR273/289/2