equested. Main CI 40693030763 exact b2ae: Node22/24 PASS, Linux active. PR299 004234de: Node22/24 active, CodeQL/JS-TS pass, Entire pending. PR302 659d6a6: Node22/24, CodeQL/JS-TS pass, Linux active, Entire pending; fresh review pending. PR305 f7e573e: Node22 and Node24 both fail, each 1882 pass/2 fail/2 skip; durable_continuity.test.ts fails expected explicit-restart recovery warning; tdd_work_units.test.ts fake agent lacks restartConversation; Linux skipped. No merged integration/RC; acceptance IN_PROGRESS, issue #1 has no custodian reply and terminal matrix 0/15., checkpoint_time_utc=2026-10-28T14:34:00Z, checkpoint_summary=Live refresh: origin/main b2ae2fe82640e44d58ef5418f49b46df03392212; latest release RC10. PR299 full CI passes but Entire trail14 FAILED because no reviewer approved. PR300 full CI passes but Entire trail15 FAILED for same missing approval. PR302 Node24/JS/TS/CodeQL pass, Node22 running; Entire reports five unresolved high findings plus no approval. PR305 Node22/24/JS/TS/CodeQL pass; Linux and Entire active. Independent reviewer ACCEPT covers exact heads, but reviewer cannot access Entire due unavailable auth/keyring. Held-out issue #1 remains open and unassigned; no custodian reply since 12:42 UTC., current_action=Poll the existing suite until final summary and claim release. Then run the focused build-identity regression in its isolated branch. Entire reviewer approvals/findings and held-out custody remain separate release blockers., entire_status=Entire local brain brief completed and supplied release invariants. Semantic/history checkpoint search via entire search and recap remains unavailable: login token cannot load from missing org.freedesktop.secrets. Brain status reports dirty/unindexed shared worktree; no repair attempted., latest_progress=At 2026-10-28 15:21 UTC, independent source review ACCEPT is recorded for build-identity patch (diff SHA c0c7b8be14de2cf1aab3246b2f34596ba4aae30c2d527c1afbe93e1ce0105295), no tests in review. PR302 patched snapshot build+full make test process PID 3669407 is still active with SUITE claim, log mtime 15:21:39Z at 1,007,171 bytes; latest tests in upgrade crash recovery passed. No terminal summary yet., blocker=PR299/300/302/305 remain blocked by Entire reviewer approval; PR302 also has five unresolved high findings. The account context is stored but unusable in this headless session due missing keyring service. Held-out custodian remains unresponsive; final RC and terminal matrix pending., release_state=origin/main=b2ae2fe82640e44d58ef5418f49b46df03392212; latest prerelease=RC10; no accepted RC or stable v1.0.0; acceptance IN_PROGRESS., acceptance=IN_PROGRESS; no accepted RC or stable v1.0.0 release., added_scope_review=On origin/main, the user-listed codebase gaps are already substantially addressed: capabilities split by category; scheduler extracted; runner split into execution/revalidation/persistence/diagnostics; DecisionRejected behavior documented; generated scheduler invariants and convergence integration tests exist; operator config is supported. Relevant PR273/289/296 commits are in origin/main but not RC10, so next RC must include them., latest_update=Live refresh 2026-10-28 14:52 UTC: origin/main b2ae2fe unchanged; latest release RC10. PR299/300/302/305 each have Linux SUCCESS and Entire Gates FAILURE; #302's terminal Entire summary is five high findings plus no approval. Held-out issue #1 remains open/unassigned with last custodian request at 14:23 UTC and no response. The independent patched PR302 snapshot full build+test process PID 3669407 remains alive with SUITE claim and advancing log (14:52:01Z), currently in verification/finding continuity tests; it is not exact committed-head evidence. Main dirty worktree remains untouched., next_checkpoint=Continue polling PID 3669407 and capture final exit plus summary/claim release. Then verify the build-identity regression and seek independent review. No PR merge until Entire trails and findings/approvals clear., updated 3 minutes ago\\n  - [done] PR #285 scheduler extraction (detail=Integrated in main at d3b7af3. Full lifecycle integration tests are in cli/test/convergence_integration.test.ts; 100 deterministic generated DAGs with dependency-order and convergence assertions are in cli/test/convergence_scheduler_properties.test.ts.), updated about 11 hours ago\\n  - [done] PR #287 runner decomposition (detail=Merged as 59f07c467ad7c503b92f104ca6420d4d5e67a5d2; split revalidation, execution, persistence and diagnostics into focused modules.), updated about 11 hours ago\\n  - [done] PR #289 configurable operation policy (detail=Merged PR #289 at 2026-10-28 06:08:32Z as bf8700f92fc5156d246ecc9de59ace12ec49c842 after exact-head Node22/24/Linux, JS/TS, CodeQL checks passed and independent exact-head ACCEPT. Post-merge CI 40642067516 and CodeQL are running. This adds operator-only ~/.config/nexus/config.json operationPolicy plus environment/legacy precedence; other app settings remain outside this change.), updated about 9 hours ago\\n  - [done] PR #293 DecisionRejected operator documentation (detail=Merged at 05:10:17Z as a219580e4e5dd70997124d49b764a30fbb675793. Exact PR head7cc3cfaa had all protected required checks, JS/TS and CodeQL green; Entire Gates was neutral at merge. Post-merge main CI runs 40636416555 and 40636416736 are still in progress.), updated about 10 hours ago\\n  - [doing] Nexus v1.0.0 acceptance and publication (detail=Fresh 2026-10-28 GitHub refresh: origin/main remains b2ae2fe82640e44d58ef5418f49b46df03392212; main CI 40693030763 and CodeQL 40693030710 SUCCESS. PR299 exact 004234de: Node22/24, JS/TS, CodeQL pass; Linux/Entire running. PR300 exact 11dc196: independent factual ACCEPT, diff 2ab25de...; Node22/24, JS/TS, CodeQL pass; Linux/Entire running. Entire #15 findings/freshness pass but approvals missing; reviewer cannot authenticate because org.freedesktop.secrets service unavailable in their session. PR302 advanced to exact head 3c52580a6da6b7f1282018f4d3702dcb75f8bd7 after two new commits; JS/TS and CodeQL pass, exact Node22/24 CI and Entire active; independent exact-cumulative review requested with diff SHA d90aeb05a9f5c5d0a35bfa0f597d96cc39a5f6480e22b20094f7523cd4cacdff. PR305 exact 97f1c6ea: CodeQL/JS-TS pass, Node22/24 and Entire running; independent ACCEPT and 8/8 focused tests recorded. No candidate mergeable yet. Held-out issue #1 remains unassigned/unanswered since 12:42 UTC; no payload touched. Terminal matrix remains pending final installed RC.), updated about 1 hour ago\\n  - [done] PR #286 capability category extraction (detail=Merged in current origin/main ancestry at a687ebd. 36 baseline capability definitions preserved and registration order reviewed.), updated about 11 hours ago\\n  - [done] Current requirements source-stage enforcement (detail=On refreshed candidate 3f66ee138b1d8aeded2902851f659873d887f307, isolated-HOME `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` passed: ledger now 123 rows, tested 108, partial 6, implemented 2, open 7; 12 listed as deferred to exact-RC qualification. This source-stage pass does not satisfy installed-RC acceptance and must not be reported as all requirements accepted.), updated about 12 hours ago\\n  - [done] PR #292 test-first operation work units review (detail=The previously identified risk is resolved in current origin/main: cli/src/core/independent_check.ts keeps the pre-change baseline and failed result separate from tddRedVerifier/tddRedTests; cli/test/tdd_work_units.test.ts asserts a model-authored RED failure does not rewrite baseline.failed or enter baseline.tests; docs/v1.0.0/TDD-WORK-UNITS.md specifies RED evidence cannot make GREEN VERIFIED. Integrated via PR #295 at ceaf600; exact-head checks and independent ACCEPT passed there. This read-only verification ran no tests.), updated about 8 hours ago\\n  - [done] TDD independent verifier baseline correctness defect (detail=The separation of RED-authored tests from independent pre-change evidence is integrated on current main through PR #295. Current source, regression tests and TDD docs confirm the original baseline result remains unchanged; exact checks and independent ACCEPT passed at PR integration. This turn verified source/docs read-only; no tests run.), updated about 8 hours ago\\n  - [done] PR #296 scheduler observer diagnostics (detail=Merged PR #296 at 2026-10-28 06:02:48Z as c0480f0ba5331c6e56352f019d21053e46f26641 after exact-head Node22/24/Linux, JS/TS, CodeQL checks passed and independent exact-head ACCEPT. Post-merge CI 40641489389 is running; release-critical behavior is integrated, but post-merge CI is still pending.), updated about 9 hours ago\\n  - [done] PR #295 exact-head read-only review (detail=PR #295 merged at ceaf60072b7c364edac523d2517fb12df8f5f6cd after exact-head Node22/24/Linux, JS/TS, CodeQL, and independent ACCEPT. The 21-case docs count correction is included. Historical review concern resolved.), updated about 8 hours ago\\n  - [done] Central operator configuration file for v1 (detail=The operator-only versioned ~/.config/nexus/config.json policy implementation was merged in PR #289 at bf8700f and is on current main. The later malformed-config doctor/startup recovery remains separately owned in PR #299; that PR's base is stale and its owner must refresh it. This item no longer owns active implementation.), updated about 8 hours ago\\n  - [doing] Reconcile evaluation task coverage for v1 (detail=Exact `origin/main@7970958749fc17be3b0ef4bb725b8e2f0d825ed4` public eval/README.md:169-175 states legacy `hidden:{dir,command}` is development/pilot only, qualification preflight accepts isolated `blackbox-v1` only, and any legacy qualification task must be replaced/converted by authorized custodian with repeated custody checks and a new immutable manifest identity. Public `eval/heldout-manifest.json` still records 40 tasks: 10 each bugfix/debug/feature/refactor across Go/JavaScript/Python/Rust. No protected payload was accessed. Existing READINESS.md already records this incompatibility at line 678; no doc patch needed. Custodian issue #1 remains unanswered since 2026-10-27T18:47:09Z.), updated about 7 hours ago\\n  - [done] Add code review findings to v1.0.0 release scope (detail=Verified against exact current main ceaf6007 and added a new 07:21 UTC checkpoint to docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md in claimed worktree; commit ffc26ecee4e1cdc416b0c807336d3b91fa2fa4aa. Records implemented splits/diagnostics, merged DecisionRejected guidance, lifecycle/generated tests, precise limited config scope, and held-out/exact-RC gates still open. Docs diff-check passes; tests not run because SUITE is claimed by kimi-main. Local branch is clean; integration awaits owner push under AGENTS.md.), updated about 8 hours ago\\n  - [done] PR #297 exact-head integration (detail=Merged on origin/main at 7970958749fc17be3b0ef4bb725b8e2f0d825ed4. Exact-head Node22/24, Linux, JS/TS and CodeQL passed; Entire Gates was neutral. Post-merge main CI 40652572596 completed SUCCESS and CodeQL 40652572591 passed.), updated about 6 hours ago\\n  - [doing] Triage silent catches named by code review (detail=At main 7970958749fc17be3b0ef4bb725b8e2f0d825ed4, runner decomposition and bounded diagnostics landed through PRs 287/295/296; PR297 merged regression coverage for TDD diagnostic paths. The old reviewed paths are surfaced with bounded diagnostics; remaining catches in operation_runner.ts are expected cancellation handling and URL normalization fallback. Do not log raw errors or alter these semantics.), updated about 7 hours ago\\n  - [doing] Evaluator resource enforcement on current main (detail=Current main advanced to 7970958749fc17be3b0ef4bb725b8e2f0d825ed4 via PR297; evaluator implementation unchanged from ceaf600. Read-only source review still finds fail-closed Linux cgroup v2 CPU/memory/pids controls, dedicated tmpfs, preflight and escaped-process cleanup fixtures. Post-merge main CI 40652572596 is running; do not start local full suite while SUITE ownership is held.), updated about 7 hours ago\\n  - [done] Exact-main requirements gate (detail=On clean isolated worktree at exact origin/main 7970958749fc17be3b0ef4bb725b8e2f0d825ed4, ran node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce with isolated HOME. Exit 0: 123 rows; tested 108, partial 6, implemented 2, open 7; 12 explicit exact-RC deferrals. This is source-stage gate evidence only, not exact-RC or installed qualification.), updated about 7 hours ago\\n  - [doing] Include requested codebase review findings in v1.0.0 scope and reconcile implementation/evidence (detail=Updated current readiness checkpoint locally in claimed worktree: structural splits, bounded runner diagnostics, DecisionRejected guidance merged, lifecycle/generated scheduler tests, limited operator config.json scope, and still-open 40-task independent held-out qualification. Exact origin/main ceaf6007 source status: Node22/24 CI passed, Linux CI in progress; acceptance remains IN_PROGRESS.), updated about 8 hours ago\\n  - [doing] Include requested code review findings in v1.0.0 scope and reconcile implementation/evidence (detail=Current main origin/main=b2ae2fe82640e44d58ef5418f49b46df03392212; exact main CI 40693030763 and CodeQL 40693030710 both SUCCESS. PR300 # current head 11dc196fcdd733f8de71dfc95ff70e109d8f4492, base exact; independent factual review ACCEPT, diff SHA256 2ab25de0645cb96bc4f874f35e4f327817f93a29216c12ef463ad380192b6513. PR body corrected. Node22/24, JS/TS, CodeQL pass; Linux job started 13:56:53Z and still running; Entire #15 findings/up-to-date pass but no trail reviewer approval. Reviewer cannot use Entire approval CLI in this session because system keyring service org.freedesktop.secrets is unavailable; did not impersonate. PR299 head 004234de Node22/24 and JS/TS/CodeQL pass, Linux/Entire running. PR302 head 8ebb8fa was pushed anew, JS/TS/CodeQL pass, Node matrix/Entire running; independent ACCEPT and 49/49 targeted tests recorded. PR305 head 97f1c6ea JS/TS/CodeQL pass, Node matrix/Entire running; independent ACCEPT and focused 8/8 tests recorded. Acceptance still IN_PROGRESS; custody and terminal gates remain unresolved.), updated about 1 hour ago\\n  - [done] E3 terminal capture preflight (detail=Completed host-only preflight on ubuntu-desktop: GNOME Wayland active, xterm 407, kitty 0.45.0, GNOME Terminal 3.58.0/VTE 0.84.0, tmux 3.6, VS Code 1.143.1. gnome-screenshot binary is absent, but org.gnome.Shell.Screenshot is reachable on the user bus with Screenshot/ScreenshotArea methods. Installed Nexus is RC10 (source 16ee8ca; archive SHA retained) and is stale versus current source. No screenshot captured; no Nexus launched; 0/15 cells. Preflight slice claim released; worksheet file claim remains reserved.), updated about 7 hours ago\\n  - [todo] E3 manual terminal matrix on final installed RC (detail=Desktop preflight now confirmed remotely at 10.0.8.3: Ubuntu 26.04, active local Wayland session on seat0, xterm 407, kitty 0.45.0, GNOME Terminal 3.58.0, tmux 3.6, VS Code 1.143.1 all installed; RC10 qualification binary reports 1.0.0-rc.10 (16ee8ca36438). This is setup evidence only; do not count any matrix cells. Exact acceptance remains five environments × 80x24/40x14/200x60, with seven checks and two screenshots per cell, against the final installed RC. The final RC does not exist yet.), updated about 6 hours ago\\n  - [doing] Malformed operator config doctor PR #299 (detail=Merged origin/main b293b441 into branch and fixed independent-review docs finding in commit 38837c88e73cb54e4032606941c8aec8262d291c: manual now states invalid operator config blocks commands except doctor and directs recovery. Normal fast-forward branch push completed. Exact-head CI and fresh independent review pending.), updated about 4 hours ago\\n  - [doing] Resolve conflicting PR #302 ignored-directory review evidence (detail=PR #302 now pushed at exact head c3aaf60e2822de90df9586db4e2ac74d9c4523b0, cumulative from 0f04bb58.