{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T15:26:08.597Z","ordinal":461596,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a1831e-47db-7583-982e-1aab45c43e6a","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-ee2ef848-9243-44e9-8da9-bbec52d390ed","server":"mcp-search","tool":"work_state_read","arguments":{"list":"nexus-operation-review-findings-20261028"},"pluginId":"claude-mem@claude-mem-local","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"- nexus-operation-review-findings-20261028: detail=Checkpoint 2026-10-28 13:35:27 UTC. Corrected PR #300 readiness record after independent reviewer CHANGES_REQUIRED on 484cfbf. PR #300 head 96cc7dcb3235ef8d12f7e12025dd24e8e4ef92b5, base b2ae2fe, cumulative diff SHA 01418bd9d9b39f5de0c98eb513d3b627525e4dfa149cdf03109a5dba12ddedbf; docs diff-check PASS; exact-head CI active, independent factual re-review requested. Main CI 40693030763 exact b2ae: Node22/24 PASS, Linux active. PR299 004234de: Node22/24 active, CodeQL/JS-TS pass, Entire pending. PR302 659d6a6: Node22/24, CodeQL/JS-TS pass, Linux active, Entire pending; fresh review pending. PR305 f7e573e: Node22 and Node24 both fail, each 1882 pass/2 fail/2 skip; durable_continuity.test.ts fails expected explicit-restart recovery warning; tdd_work_units.test.ts fake agent lacks restartConversation; Linux skipped. No merged integration/RC; acceptance IN_PROGRESS, issue #1 has no custodian reply and terminal matrix 0/15., checkpoint_time_utc=2026-10-28T14:34:00Z, checkpoint_summary=Live refresh: origin/main b2ae2fe82640e44d58ef5418f49b46df03392212; latest release RC10. PR299 full CI passes but Entire trail14 FAILED because no reviewer approved. PR300 full CI passes but Entire trail15 FAILED for same missing approval. PR302 Node24/JS/TS/CodeQL pass, Node22 running; Entire reports five unresolved high findings plus no approval. PR305 Node22/24/JS/TS/CodeQL pass; Linux and Entire active. Independent reviewer