urrent_action=Poll the existing suite until final summary and claim release. Then run the focused build-identity regression in its isolated branch. Entire reviewer approvals/findings and held-out custody remain separate release blockers., entire_status=Entire local brain brief completed and supplied release invariants. Semantic/history checkpoint search via entire search and recap remains unavailable: login token cannot load from missing org.freedesktop.secrets. Brain status reports dirty/unindexed shared worktree; no repair attempted., latest_progress=At 2026-10-28 15:21 UTC, independent source review ACCEPT is recorded for build-identity patch (diff SHA c0c7b8be14de2cf1aab3246b2f34596ba4aae30c2d527c1afbe93e1ce0105295), no tests in review. PR302 patched snapshot build+full make test process PID 3669407 is still active with SUITE claim, log mtime 15:21:39Z at 1,007,171 bytes; latest tests in upgrade crash recovery passed. No terminal summary yet., blocker=PR299/300/302/305 remain blocked by Entire reviewer approval; PR302 also has five unresolved high findings. The account context is stored but unusable in this headless session due missing keyring service. Held-out custodian remains unresponsive; final RC and terminal matrix pending., release_state=origin/main=b2ae2fe82640e44d58ef5418f49b46df03392212; latest prerelease=RC10; no accepted RC or stable v1.0.0; acceptance IN_PROGRESS., acceptance=IN_PROGRESS; no accepted RC or stable v1.0.0 release., added_scope_review=On origin/main, the user-listed codebase gaps are already substantially addressed: capabilities split by category; scheduler extracted; runner split into execution/revalidation/persistence/diagnostics; DecisionRejected behavior documented; generated scheduler invariants and convergence integration tests exist; operator config is supported. Relevant PR273/289/296 commits are in origin/main but not RC10, so next RC must include them., latest_update=Live refresh 2026-10-28 14:52 UTC: origin/main b2ae2fe unchanged; latest release RC10. PR299/300/302/305 each have Linux SUCCESS and Entire Gates FAILURE; #302's terminal Entire summary is five high findings plus no approval. Held-out issue #1 remains open/unassigned with last custodian request at 14:23 UTC and no response. The independent patched PR302 snapshot full build+test process PID 3669407 remains alive with SUITE claim and advancing log (14:52:01Z), currently in verification/finding continuity tests; it is not exact committed-head evidence. Main dirty worktree remains untouched., next_checkpoint=Continue polling PID 3669407 and capture final exit plus summary/claim release. Then verify the build-identity regression and seek independent review. No PR merge until Entire trails and findings/approvals clear., updated 4 minutes ago\\n  - [doing] Nexus v1.0.0 acceptance and publication (detail=Fresh 2026-10-28 GitHub refresh: origin/main remains b2ae2fe82640e44d58ef5418f49b46df03392212; main CI 40693030763 and CodeQL 40693030710 SUCCESS. PR299 exact 004234de: Node22/24, JS/TS, CodeQL pass; Linux/Entire running. PR300 exact 11dc196: independent factual ACCEPT, diff 2ab25de...; Node22/24, JS/TS, CodeQL pass; Linux/Entire running. Entire #15 findings/freshness pass but approvals missing; reviewer cannot authenticate because org.freedesktop.secrets service unavailable in their session. PR302 advanced to exact head 3c52580a6da6b7f1282018f4d3702dcb75f8bd7 after two new commits; JS/TS and CodeQL pass, exact Node22/24 CI and Entire active; independent exact-cumulative review requested with diff SHA d90aeb05a9f5c5d0a35bfa0f597d96cc39a5f6480e22b20094f7523cd4cacdff. PR305 exact 97f1c6ea: CodeQL/JS-TS pass, Node22/24 and Entire running; independent ACCEPT and 8/8 focused tests recorded. No candidate mergeable yet. Held-out issue #1 remains unassigned/unanswered since 12:42 UTC; no payload touched. Terminal matrix remains pending final installed RC.), updated about 1 hour ago\\n  - [doing] Reconcile evaluation task coverage for v1 (d