{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T15:28:05.017Z","ordinal":461687,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a1831e-47db-7583-982e-1aab45c43e6a","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-47bfe43e-7039-4bf0-b608-3cbdc69265fd","process_id":"56116","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","rg -n 'PR #29|PR #30|Current checkpoint|Exact-head|Acceptance status|current|2026-10-28' /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc-readiness-refresh-20261028/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md | tail -70"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"search","cmd":"rg -n 'PR #29|PR #30|Current checkpoint|Exact-head|Acceptance status|current|2026-10-28' /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc-readiness-refresh-20261028/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md","query":"PR #29|PR #30|Current checkpoint|Exact-head|Acceptance status|current|2026-10-28","path":"READINESS.md"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"122:**Readiness PR and local full-suite result:** PR [#268](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/268) remains remotely at `bda6714ff885f2fd4fef736b84ca7005a9cddbdf`, based on `303ea322a7148b4a9d1a8231d7ce1c8f824bbae4`; it is conflicting with current `main` and its old successful checks are stale. The claimed local branch had been refreshed through `bff9f13085368e6cc269b1bb294db5b3b810bd7a`; the updated branch now incorporates `1d9357e` and is awaiting final independent review. No push or merge is claimed.\n128:The 12:42 checkpoint immediately below is retained as historical evidence and superseded for current branch, CI, and test status by this checkpoint.\n138:**Readiness PR:** PR [#268](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/268) remains open remotely at `bda6714ff885f2fd4fef736b84ca7005a9cddbdf`, based on `303ea322a7148b4a9d1a8231d7ce1c8f824bbae4`. The local claimed candidate `9344df578f8a39a55d82ead0f15c4811864d21f8` has not passed final-base independent review: the reviewer correctly found its current PR/CI statement stale after PR #264 merged. This checkpoint corrects that statement; the candidate requires fresh exact-head independent review and then owner push and hosted checks. No merge is claimed.\n142:**Candidate and gates:** The latest public release remains prerelease [v1.0.0-rc.10](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.10), built from `16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0` with archive SHA-256 `444d0812ad583b7f688890ac8536cb872e92364c977d9fbf298fa0408d98b3e7`. Stable `v1.0.0` is unpublished. The required real-terminal matrix remains **0/15**; scripted terminal evidence does not replace operator evidence. Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) has no recorded custodian acceptance; no private payload was accessed or run. T2/T3/T4, exact-current-RC provider/standalone and cross-runner qualification, and independent exact-RC acceptance remain incomplete. Acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`; publication authorization is granted but gated. The distribution target is the GitHub installer; npm publication is inapplicable.\n144:The 11:58 checkpoint immediately below is retained as historical evidence and superseded for current source, PR, CI and acceptance state by this checkpoint.\n152:**Current release PRs:** PR [#264](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/264) is open at `97e3f72e4a5fe8676a0a30ea9f6e023147ad73a5` on current base `d2442b0`; CodeQL [40499839711](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40499839711) passed and exact-head CI [40499840211](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40499840211) is still running. PR [#268](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/268) remains remotely at `bda6714ff885f2fd4fef736b84ca7005a9cddbdf`, based on the previous `303ea32` source. Its earlier CI and CodeQL passed on that older head. A local readiness candidate has been refreshed to `d2442b0`; requirement enforcement (123 rows: 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open), RC10 version synchronization, and diff hygiene pass on the refreshed candidate. Independent review asked that the old 05:54 snapshot be clearly superseded; this checkpoint does so. The refreshed candidate still needs final-base review, owner push, and exact-head hosted checks.\n154:**Installed RC and qualification:** The latest public release remains prerelease [v1.0.0-rc.10](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.10), built from `16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0` with archive SHA-256 `444d0812ad583b7f688890ac8536cb872e92364c977d9fbf298fa0408d98b3e7`. No stable `v1.0.0` release appears among the current public releases. The human five-terminal, three-size matrix remains **0/15**; scripted terminal evidence is partial and does not replace the operator matrix. Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) has no custodian response to the latest metadata-only request (2026-10-26); no held-out payload was accessed or run. T2/T3/T4, standalone/provider qualification, and independent exact-RC acceptance remain incomplete.\n156:**Disposition:** Acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`. RC10 is unaccepted and stable `v1.0.0` is unpublished. Existing publication authorization remains gated on all required qualification and independent acceptance. The 05:54 checkpoint below is retained as historical evidence and is superseded for source, PR #266 integration, current PR checks, and release-gate status by this checkpoint.\n174:**Open convergence PRs:** PR [#264](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/264) remains open remotely at `73bdc7d91b1b8925b522b052d89228d99bad4893` on stale base `2622663313132864677cfdc93c94944d26a3ac06`; its old-head CI [40444141362](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40444141362) and CodeQL [40444141418](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40444141418) passed. A local rebase at `7de902390a9dc49586b3f26448961557ee11a063` on `14a9c15` has independent ACCEPT with unchanged diff SHA-256 `7fb392ce6d4e09e5e69649769a42ee2e994eb66581f65070106b034fc81ca7ad`; exact checks on that local head still require the owner to update the remote PR branch. PR [#266](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/266) remote checks apply to its old head `11fc29ba39bc76624c55d34a1fc12b4d7544522a` and base `2622663`. Its refreshed local candidate `bb20b9ea226984a3a3880f65c3cdef71ff81fbe2` on `14a9c15` resolves the independent Python import-binding findings, passes the focused tests 5/5 and CLI build, and has independent ACCEPT for diff SHA-256 `78637e6c71a0d2b96990d4f0678f04324590612cb8ff20a4ef7bedfd1a6680c6`. New exact-head CI requires an owner update to the remote branch. PR [#267](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/267) remains open at `d0cac8b959e3da8595a41651a60a2fcd3738d034` on `14a9c15`, with independent scoped ACCEPT and focused provider-connect tests 37/37; CodeQL [40445472139](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40445472139) passed, Node 22/24 passed in CI [40445472051](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40445472051), and Linux packaging remains in progress. PR [#268](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/268) still has its earlier checkpoint head `959f0c81bce316efaa4be750c7d6c2e75e7d8025`; its prior independent review requested an accurate record of PR #266's then-open findings. This checkpoint records the remediation and current review disposition. No PR #264, #266, #267, or #268 merge is claimed here.\n178:**RC and remaining acceptance:** Public [v1.0.0-rc.10](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.10) remains an unaccepted prerelease from source `16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0`, not the current main source. PR #265's merged OpenRouter evidence covers one pinned-model verification and one synthetic small task. Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains open without custodian acceptance; no held-out task payload was accessed or run. Installed exact-RC qualification, standalone/provider matrix coverage, T2/T3/T4, the complete terminal matrix, and independent exact-RC acceptance remain incomplete. No stable `v1.0.0` tag or release is published. Existing publication authorization remains gated on every mandatory acceptance gate.\n180:The checkpoint immediately below is retained as the earlier 03:44 UTC snapshot and is superseded for current CI, PR review and human-terminal observations.\n188:**Current convergence PRs:** PR [#264](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/264), head `73bdc7d91b1b8925b522b052d89228d99bad4893` on base `2622663313132864677cfdc93c94944d26a3ac06`, has independent ACCEPT; Node 22, Node 24, JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL passed, while its Linux package job remains in progress. It records scripted terminal evidence only and does not complete the manual terminal gate. PR [#266](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/266), head `11fc29ba39bc76624c55d34a1fc12b4d7544522a` on the same prior base, has Node 24, JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL passing; its Node 22 TUI test failure is being rerun, currently in progress. PR [#267](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/267), head `d0cac8b959e3da8595a41651a60a2fcd3738d034` on current base `14a9c15`, carries the malformed credential-origin fix. Its exact two-file diff has independent ACCEPT (SHA-256 `2da500d09522bc059f63b07251953c552ac2270168c72d43920b181e44fd89d3`) and the focused provider connection suite passed 37/37 after rebase; its Node 22 and Node 24 jobs are running and CodeQL passed. None of these PRs is integrated yet. PR #265 merged at `14a9c152`; its exact-head CI and CodeQL passed. Its OpenRouter evidence covers one pinned-model verification and one synthetic small task, not full provider or standalone qualification.\n190:**RC10 artifact boundary:** The latest published prerelease is [v1.0.0-rc.10](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus