`2622663`. Its refreshed local candidate `bb20b9ea226984a3a3880f65c3cdef71ff81fbe2` on `14a9c15` resolves the independent Python import-binding findings, passes the focused tests 5/5 and CLI build, and has independent ACCEPT for diff SHA-256 `78637e6c71a0d2b96990d4f0678f04324590612cb8ff20a4ef7bedfd1a6680c6`. New exact-head CI requires an owner update to the remote branch. PR [#267](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/267) remains open at `d0cac8b959e3da8595a41651a60a2fcd3738d034` on `14a9c15`, with independent scoped ACCEPT and focused provider-connect tests 37/37; CodeQL [40445472139](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40445472139) passed, Node 22/24 passed in CI [40445472051](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40445472051), and Linux packaging remains in progress. PR [#268](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/268) still has its earlier checkpoint head `959f0c81bce316efaa4be750c7d6c2e75e7d8025`; its prior independent review requested an accurate record of PR #266's then-open findings. This checkpoint records the remediation and current review disposition. No PR #264, #266, #267, or #268 merge is claimed here.\\n\\n**Terminal observation and acceptance:** The user reports that the client rendered at the sizes they tried except in tmux inside GNOME Terminal; the smallest observed tmux window was 43×13. They said the remaining observations may take several days. No screenshots, exact installed-package identity, or cell-by-cell results were supplied. The 15-cell worksheet therefore remains 0/15 and unaccepted; the report is retained as provisional operator context only. Do not prompt while other gates can progress.\\n\\n**RC and remaining acceptance:** Public [v1.0.0-rc.10](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.10) remains an unaccepted prerelease from source `16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0`, not the current main source. PR #265's merged OpenRouter evidence covers one pinned-model verification and one synthetic small task. Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains open without custodian acceptance; no held-out task payload was accessed or run. Installed exact-RC qualification, standalone/provider matrix coverage, T2/T3/T4, the complete terminal matrix, and independent exact-RC acceptance remain incomplete. No stable `v1.0.0` tag or release is published. Existing publication authorization remains gated on every mandatory acceptance gate.\\n\\nThe checkpoint immediately below is retained as the earlier 03:44 UTC snapshot and is superseded for current CI, PR review and human-terminal observations.\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1831e-47db-7583-982e-1aab45c43e6a","create_time":1793201292.3045251}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
