alification is additionally blocked by independent held-out custody and the required human terminal matrix. Existing publication authorization remains granted but gated. The checkpoint below is retained as the 13:34 UTC snapshot and is superseded for current CI, requirements, PR checks, local suite result, and release status.\n+\n ## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-28 13:34:51 UTC)\n","move_path":null}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc-readiness-refresh-20261028/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\n","stderr":""},"started_at_ms":1793201377673,"completed_at_ms":1793201377677}}
