{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T15:31:25.738Z","ordinal":461852,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0db389702a7164cc016ae21549e060819fba58aee859dc1fe4","status":"completed","call_id":"call_4c1be533e625495b96e8c23070dabfcc","name":"exec","input":"const r=await tools.mcp__mcp_search__work_state_write({\n list:\"nexus-operation-review-findings-20261028\",\n fields:{\n  task:\"Refresh exact-main requirements gate and release readiness checkpoint\",\n  status:\"doing\",\n  latest_progress:\"Fresh live refresh: origin/main remains b2ae2fe82640e44d58ef5418f49b46df03392212; exact-main CI 40693030763 and CodeQL 40693030710 SUCCESS. Clean detached exact-main `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` passed: 123 rows, 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open, 12 deferred to exact-RC. PRs #299/#300/#302/#305 have required Node22/24, Linux, JS/TS, CodeQL checks green but Entire Gates failed; #302 trail reports five high findings and no reviewer approval. Latest GitHub release remains RC10; issue #1 open/unassigned with no custodian reply after 14:23 UTC request. Local make build succeeded on PR302 snapshot; make test stopped because NEXUS_EVAL_TEST_WORKSPACE_ROOT was unset. Current host has expected 128 MiB tmpfs at /mnt/nexus-eval-ci mode 0711 and /opt/nexus-eval-ci-runtime exists, but prior run did not export fixture vars. SUITE owner record is kimi-main for operation_git focused tests; no attempt to test while claimed. Readiness doc updated in claimed branch and diff check passes; independent factual review requested.\",\n  next_checkpoint:\"Obtain independent review of readiness doc, then integrate its exact evidence update through PR #300 with renewed exact-head checks. Respect SUITE claim handoff, then rerun appropriate local tests with required fixture variables, isolated HOME, and one suite owner. Continue toward custodian acceptance and final installed RC gates.\",\n  suite_status:\"Owner kimi-main claim remains; process PID from prior focused test no longer present in local namespace. Do not infer owner inactivity solely from absent PID; seek safe-boundary status/release before testing.\",\n  acceptance:\"IN_PROGRESS; no accepted RC or stable v1.0.0 release.\"\n }\n});\ntext(JSON.stringify(r));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1831e-47db-7583-982e-1aab45c43e6a","create_time":1793201482.1425216}}}
