{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T15:46:20.232Z","ordinal":462533,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0db389702a7164cc016ae218cbbb8c819f802d32ab46a71ac5","status":"completed","call_id":"call_297a05362d2f4ca1baa16923fc98c43a","name":"exec","input":"const xs = ALL_TOOLS.filter(x => x.name.includes(\"mcp_agent_mail\") && /send|inbox|list_agents|register|message/.test(x.name+\" \"+x.description));\ntext(xs.map(x=>({name:x.name,description:x.description.slice(0,500)})));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1832d-e18e-7161-a886-2d19338160bd","create_time":1793202379.734287}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T15:46:20.361Z","ordinal":462534,"type":"token_usage_record","payload":{"thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a1832d-e18e-7161-a886-2d19338160bd","session_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","root_turn_id":"01a1832d-e18e-7161-a886-2d19338160bd","response_id":"resp_0db389702a7164cc016ae218c6c664819fa6e284ade19077e4","usage":{"input_tokens":124484,"cached_input_tokens":120320,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":480,"reasoning_output_tokens":408,"total_tokens":124964},"turn_token_usage":{"input_tokens":2383364,"cached_input_tokens":2341120,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":11533,"reasoning_output_tokens":5774,"total_tokens":2394897},"thread_token_usage":{"input_tokens":8583382090,"cached_input_tokens":8491658880,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":24481709,"reasoning_output_tokens":14169973,"total_tokens":8607863799}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T15:46:20.365Z","ordinal":462535,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a18330-de4d-7dc1-90e3-1c93b6905438","call_id":"call_297a05362d2f4ca1baa16923fc98c43a","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"[{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__acknowledge_message\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nAcknowledge a message addressed to an agent (and mark as read).\\n\\nBehavior\\n--------\\n- Sets both read_ts and ack_ts for the (agent, message) pairing\\n- Safe to call multiple times; subsequent calls will return the prior timestamps\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__archive_project\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nSoft-delete a project: mark it as archived so it is hidden from active project lists. All messages are preserved and the project can be restored with unarchive_project.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__create_agent_identity\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nCreate a new, unique agent identity and persist its profile to Git.\\n\\nHow this differs from `register_agent`\\n--------------------------------------\\n- Always creates a new identity with a fresh unique name (never updates an exist\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__deregister_agent\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nRemove an agent from a project. Marks the agent as inactive and removes it from the active roster. Messages from/to the agent are preserved for audit but the agent can no longer send or receive new messages.\\n\\nexec tool declarat\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__ensure_project\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nIdempotently create or ensure a project exists for the given human key.\\n\\nWhen to use\\n-----------\\n- First call in a workflow targeting a new repo/path identifier.\\n- As a guard before registering agents or sending messages.\\n\\nHow \"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__expire_window\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nMark a window identity as expired.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_key : str\\n    Project identifier.\\nwindow_uuid : str\\n    The UUID of the window identity to expire.\\n\\nReturns\\n-------\\ndict\\n    { window_uuid, expired: bool, expire\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__fetch_inbox\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nRetrieve recent messages for an agent without mutating read/ack state.\\n\\nFilters\\n-------\\n- `urgent_only`: only messages with importance in {high, urgent}\\n- `since_ts`: ISO-8601 timestamp string; messages strictly newer than this\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__fetch_summary\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nRetrieve stored project-wide summaries.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_key : str\\n    Project identifier.\\nsince_hours : float\\n    Return summaries whose end_ts is within this window (default 24h).\\nlimit : int\\n    Maximum summari\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__fetch_topic\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nFetch all messages in a project with a given topic tag, regardless of recipient.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_key : str\\n    Project identifier.\\ntopic_name : str\\n    The topic tag to filter by (case-insensitive).\\nlimit : int\\n \"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__file_reservation_paths\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nRequest advisory file reservations (leases) on project-relative paths/globs.\\n\\nSemantics\\n---------\\n- Conflicts are reported if an overlapping active exclusive reservation exists held by another agent\\n- Glob matching is symmetric\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__force_release_file_reservation\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nForce-release a stale file reservation held by another agent after inactivity heuristics.\\n\\nThe tool validates that the reservation appears abandoned (agent inactive beyond threshold and\\nno recent mail/filesystem/git activity). \"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__hard_delete_agent\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nIRREVERSIBLY delete an agent and ALL associated data: messages sent by the agent, message recipient records, file reservations, agent links, window identities, and on-disk archive files (inbox, outbox, attachments). This is NOT\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__hard_delete_project\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nIRREVERSIBLY delete a project and ALL associated data: every agent, message, message recipient, file reservation, agent link, window identity, message summary, sibling suggestion, product link, and the entire on-disk project ar\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__health_check\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nReturn basic readiness information for the Agent Mail server.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__health_check(args: { format?: string | null; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ [key: string]: un\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__install_precommit_guard\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nInstall the Agent Mail pre-commit guard into a git repository.\\n\\nThe guard blocks a commit that stages files another agent holds an\\nexclusive file reservation on (set ``AGENT_MAIL_GUARD_MODE=warn`` to only\\nwarn). Commits must ru\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__list_contacts\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nList contact links for an agent in a project.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__list_contacts(args: { agent_name: string; format?: string | null; project_key: string; registration_token?:\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__list_window_identities\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nList active window identities for a project.\\n\\nReturns all non-expired window identities with their display names,\\nlast activity timestamps, and age.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_key : str\\n    Project identifier.\\n\\nReturns\\n----\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_contact_handshake\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nRequest contact permissions and optionally auto-approve plus send a welcome message.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_contact_handshake(args: { agent_name?: string | null; auto_acc\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_file_reservation_cycle\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nReserve a set of file paths and optionally release them at the end of the workflow.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_file_reservation_cycle(args: { agent_name: string; auto_release\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_prepare_thread\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nMacro helper that aligns an agent with an existing thread by ensuring registration,\\nsummarising the thread, and fetching recent inbox context.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_prep\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_start_session\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nMacro helper that boots a project session: ensure project, register agent,\\noptionally file_reservation paths, and fetch the latest inbox snapshot.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__mark_message_read\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nMark a specific message as read for the given agent.\\n\\nNotes\\n-----\\n- Read receipts are per-recipient; this only affects the specified agent.\\n- This does not send an acknowledgement; use `acknowledge_message` for that.\\n- Safe to \"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__purge_old_messages\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nDelete messages older than the configured retention period. Defaults to retention_max_age_days from config (180 days). Returns count of messages purged.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__register_agent\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nCreate or update an agent identity within a project and persist its profile to Git.\\n\\nWhen to use\\n-----------\\n- At the start of a coding session by any automated agent.\\n- To update an existing agent's program/model/task metadata\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__release_file_reservations\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nRelease active file reservations held by an agent.\\n\\nBehavior\\n--------\\n- If both `paths` and `file_reservation_ids` are omitted, all active reservations for the agent are released\\n- Otherwise, restricts release to matching ids a\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__rename_window\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nUpdate the display name of a window identity.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_key : str\\n    Project identifier.\\nwindow_uuid : str\\n    The UUID of the window identity to rename.\\nnew_display_name : str\\n    New display name (must b\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__renew_file_reservations\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nExtend expiry for active file reservations held by an agent without reissuing them.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_key : str\\n    Project slug or human key.\\nagent_name : str\\n    Agent identity who owns the reservations.\\nextend_s\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__reply_message\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nReply to an existing message, preserving or establishing a thread.\\n\\nBehavior\\n--------\\n- Inherits original `importance` and `ack_required` flags\\n- `thread_id` is taken from the original message if present; otherwise, the origina\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__request_contact\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nRequest contact approval to message another agent.\\n\\nCreates (or refreshes) a pending AgentLink and sends a small ack_required intro message.\\n\\nDiscovery\\n---------\\nTo discover available agent names, use: resource://agents/{projec\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__respond_contact\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nApprove or deny a contact request.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__respond_contact(args: { accept: boolean; format?: string | null; from_agent: string; from_project?: string | null; pro\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__retire_agent\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nSoft-delete an agent: mark it as retired so it stops accepting new messages while preserving message history. Retired agents are hidden from active agent lists but visible in 'all agents' views.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\nde\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__search_messages\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nFull-text search over subject and body for a project.\\n\\nTips\\n----\\n- SQLite FTS5 syntax supported: phrases (\\\"build plan\\\"), prefix (mig*), boolean (plan AND users)\\n- Results are ordered by bm25 score (best matches first)\\n- Limit d\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__send_message\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nSend a Markdown message to one or more recipients and persist canonical and mailbox copies to Git.\\n\\nDiscovery\\n---------\\nTo discover available agent names for recipients, use: resource://agents/{project_key}\\nAgent names are NOT \"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__set_contact_policy\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nSet contact policy for an agent: open | auto | contacts_only | block_all.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__set_contact_policy(args: { agent_name: string; format?: string | null; policy: \"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__summarize_recent\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nSummarize all recent project messages within a time window.\\n\\nFetches messages from the last ``since_hours`` hours, groups them by\\nthread, and produces a combined project-wide summary.  Results are\\nstored in the ``message_summar\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__summarize_thread\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nExtract participants, key points, and action items for one or more threads.\\n\\nSingle-thread mode (thread_id is a single ID):\\n- Returns detailed summary with optional example messages\\n- Response: { thread_id, summary: {participan\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__sweep_stale_agents\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nRetire abandoned agents in the caller's project using the server's conservative inactivity heuristic. The caller is never retired, the threshold has a 60-second floor, and active file reservations block retirement by default.\\n\\n\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__unarchive_project\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nRestore an archived project back to active status.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__unarchive_project(args: { project_key: string; registration_token?: string | null; }): Promise<CallToo\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__uninstall_precommit_guard\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nRemove the Agent Mail commit guards from a git repository.\\n\\nRemoves Agent Mail's own pre-commit and pre-push guard plugins (and a\\nlegacy single-file Agent Mail hook); other hooks in the repository are\\nleft in place.\\n\\nParameters\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__unretire_agent\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nRestore a retired agent back to active status. The agent will resume accepting new messages.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__unretire_agent(args: { agent_name: string; project_key: stri\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__whois\",\"description\":\"You are the