{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T16:43:07.780Z","ordinal":464645,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0db389702a7164cc016ae2261a9810819fb1a0141403f57258","status":"completed","call_id":"call_4d50f38778d044bca7a46f45b41b976b","name":"exec","input":"const r=await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"entire status --json --no-pager 2>&1 || entire status 2>&1; git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/checkpoint-ordinary-child-fix status --short --branch; git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/checkpoint-ordinary-child-fix rev-parse HEAD; git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/checkpoint-ordinary-child-fix log -3 --format='%H %s%n%b' -- cli/src/checkpoint.ts cli/test/checkpoint_restore.test.ts; rg -n \\\"PR.?302|checkpoint ordinary child|checkpoint-ordinary\\\" /home/mike/.codex/memories/MEMORY.md | head -30\",yield_time_ms:10000,max_output_tokens:3000});\ntext(r.output);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1834a-d12d-7c43-8f4a-96ee044d0ace","create_time":1793205786.595432}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T16:43:07.817Z","ordinal":464646,"type":"token_usage_record","payload":{"thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a1834a-d12d-7c43-8f4a-96ee044d0ace","session_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","root_turn_id":"01a1834a-d12d-7c43-8f4a-96ee044d0ace","response_id":"resp_0db389702a7164cc016ae226183768819f8a902fb433a11827","usage":{"input_tokens":78297,"cached_input_tokens":74624,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":377,"reasoning_output_tokens":191,"total_tokens":78674},"turn_token_usage":{"input_tokens":22255873,"cached_input_tokens":22066432,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":89116,"reasoning_output_tokens":62297,"total_tokens":22344989},"thread_token_usage":{"input_tokens":8628216368,"cached_input_tokens":8536145024,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":24627230,"reasoning_output_tokens":14268753,"total_tokens":8652843598}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T16:43:09.824Z","ordinal":464647,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a1834a-d12d-7c43-8f4a-96ee044d0ace","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-f385ba98-1b7f-482f-acc0-e29f430d93a0","process_id":"44507","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","entire status --json --no-pager 2>&1 || entire status 2>&1; git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/checkpoint-ordinary-child-fix status --short --branch; git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/checkpoint-ordinary-child-fix rev-parse HEAD; git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/checkpoint-ordinary-child-fix log -3 --format='%H %s%n%b' -- cli/src/checkpoint.ts cli/test/checkpoint_restore.test.ts; rg -n \"PR.?302|checkpoint ordinary child|checkpoint-ordinary\" /home/mike/.codex/memories/MEMORY.md | head -30"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"entire status --json --no-pager 2>&1 || entire status 2>&1; git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/checkpoint-ordinary-child-fix status --short --branch; git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/checkpoint-ordinary-child-fix rev-parse HEAD; git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/checkpoint-ordinary-child-fix log -3 --format='%H %s%n%b' -- cli/src/checkpoint.ts cli/test/checkpoint_restore.test.ts; rg -n \"PR.?302|checkpoint ordinary child|checkpoint-ordinary\" /home/mike/.codex/memories/MEMORY.md | head -30"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"Usage:\n  entire [flags]\n  entire [command]\n\nEntire Setup:\n  agent                      Manage agent integrations (add, remove, list)\n  clean                      Clean up Entire session data\n  configure                  Update Entire settings in the current repository\n  disable                    Disable Entire in current repository\n  doctor                     Diagnose and fix session issues\n  enable                     Enable Entire in current repository\n  plugin                     Manage Entire plugins (install, list, upgrade, search, remove)\n  status                     Show Entire status\n\nSessions & Checkpoints:\n  activity                   Show your activity overview\n  checkpoint                 Inspect and search checkpoints\n  dispatch                   Generate a dispatch summarizing recent agent work\n  recap                      Summarize recent checkpoint activity\n  search                     Search checkpoints, commits, and sessions using semantic and keyword matching\n  session                    Manage agent sessions tracked by Entire\n\nTrails:\n  trail                      Manage trails across repositories and branches\n\nAccount:\n  auth                       Manage authentication\n  login                      Log in to Entire\n  logout                     Log out of Entire\n\nControl Plane:\n  api                        Make an authenticated request to an Entire API and print the response\n  cluster                    Show the Entire clusters you can place projects and repos on\n  org                        Manage Entire organizations\n  project                    Manage Entire projects\n  repo                       Manage Entire repositories\n\nAdditional Commands:\n  agent-help                 Machine-readable usage for coding agents (always matches the installed CLI)\n  help                       Help about any command\n  labs                       Explore experimental Entire workflows\n  version                    Show build information\n\nFlags:\n      --context name   Act as this saved login name for this command only — including the git and agent processes it spawns — instead of the active context (entire auth contexts lists them)\n\nUse \"entire [command] --help\" for more information about a command.\n\nError: Invalid usage: unknown flag: --no-pager\n● Enabled · branch main\n  Agents · Antigravity, Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, OpenCode\n  Automatic checkpoint pushing: disabled (push_sessions=false)\n  Checkpoints read from: origin\n  637 checkpoints not on origin · see 'entire checkpoint list --outgoing'\n\n── Active Sessions ─────────────────────────────────────────\n\nCodex (gpt-6-luna) · 01a15488-7e03-70f3-9a99-99c1c2bb2f1e\nstarted 2h ago\n\nCodex (gpt-6-luna) · 01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92\n> \"<send_user_message_question_reply> [{\"questionItemId\":\"[\\...\"\nstarted 3h ago · active 1h ago · stale (run 'entire doctor')\n\nClaude Code (claude-opus-5-5) · 90831ce7-12dd-4e3f-a07d-bc2921efe403\n> \"/loop Drive Nexus Code v1.0.0 to verified release as clau...\"\nstarted 15h ago · active 20m ago · tokens 33108.2k\n\nAntigravity · b4a3bc2f-f280-4df2-b6de-50b86cdd9b0b\nstarted 15h ago · active now\n\nAntigravity · 47e461b3-2e0c-467f-ad6d-a36d7dcca78f\nstarted 15h ago · active 1m ago · tokens 57907.1k\n\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n5 sessions\n\nAgents: run `entire agent-help` for machine-readable usage.\n## v1/checkpoint-ordinary-child-fix\n M cli/src/checkpoint.ts\nb9a986edeeb156802b72d246b67c0f2425d92d9b\nb9a986edeeb156802b72d246b67c0f2425d92d9b fix(checkpoint): detect nested git directories with Git\n\n700d16bb1e3b8050f2dbfe91c4c8fd2f89a6ade4 fix(checkpoint): check out only snapshot paths\n\n49a2af0c1d556912d12b834aa7f2022ef63b528c fix(checkpoint): scope nested restore checkout\n\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":519666233}},"started_at_ms":1793205789303,"completed_at_ms":1793205789824}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T16:43:12.282Z","ordinal":464648,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a18364-ee1a-7413-84b9-27780d6757c1","call_id":"call_4d50f38778d044bca7a46f45b41b976b","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 4.5 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"Usage:\n  entire [flags]\n  entire [command]\n\nEntire Setup:\n  agent                      Manage agent integrations (add, remove, list)\n  clean                      Clean up Entire session data\n  configure                  Update Entire settings in the current repository\n  disable                    Disable Entire in current repository\n  doctor                     Diagnose and fix session issues\n  enable                     Enable Entire in current repository\n  plugin                     Manage Entire plugins (install, list, upgrade, search, remove)\n  status                     Show Entire status\n\nSessions & Checkpoints:\n  activity                   Show your activity overview\n  checkpoint                 Inspect and search checkpoints\n  dispatch                   Generate a dispatch summarizing recent agent work\n  recap                      Summarize recent checkpoint activity\n  search                     Search checkpoints, commits, and sessions using semantic and keyword matching\n  session                    Manage agent sessions tracked by Entire\n\nTrails:\n  trail                      Manage trails across repositories and branches\n\nAccount:\n  auth                       Manage authentication\n  login                      Log in to Entire\n  logout                     Log out of Entire\n\nControl Plane:\n  api                        Make an authenticated request to an Entire API and print the response\n  cluster                    Show the Entire clusters you can place projects and repos on\n  org                        Manage Entire organizations\n  project                    Manage Entire projects\n  repo                       Manage Entire repositories\n\nAdditional Commands:\n  agent-help                 Machine-readable usage for coding agents (always matches the installed CLI)\n  help                       Help about any command\n  labs                       Explore experimental Entire workflows\n  version                    Show build information\n\nFlags:\n      --context name   Act as this saved login name for this command only — including the git and agent processes it spawns — instead of the active context (entire auth contexts lists them)\n\nUse \"entire [command] --help\" for more information about a command.\n\nError: Invalid usage: unknown flag: --no-pager\n● Enabled · branch main\n  Agents · Antigravity, Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, OpenCode\n  Automatic checkpoint pushing: disabled (push_sessions=false)\n  Checkpoints read from: origin\n  637 checkpoints not on origin · see 'entire checkpoint list --outgoing'\n\n── Active Sessions ─────────────────────────────────────────\n\nCodex (gpt-6-luna) · 01a15488-7e03-70f3-9a99-99c1c2bb2f1e\nstarted 2h ago\n\nCodex (gpt-6-luna) · 01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92\n> \"<send_user_message_question_reply> [{\"questionItemId\":\"[\\...\"\nstarted 3h ago · active 1h ago · stale (run 'entire doctor')\n\nClaude Code (claude-opus-5-5) · 90831ce7-12dd-4e3f-a07d-bc2921efe403\n> \"/loop Drive Nexus Code v1.0.0 to verified release as clau...\"\nstarted 15h ago · active 20m ago · tokens 33108.2k\n\nAntigravity · b4a3bc2f-f280-4df2-b6de-50b86cdd9b0b\nstarted 15h ago · active now\n\nAntigravity · 47e461b3-2e0c-467f-ad6d-a36d7dcca78f\nstarted 15h ago · active 1m ago · tokens 57907.1k\n\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n5 sessions\n\nAgents: run `entire agent-help` for machine-readable usage.\n## v1/checkpoint-ordinary-child-fix\n M cli/src/checkpoint.ts\nb9a986edeeb156802b72d246b67c0f2425d92d9b\nb9a986edeeb156802b72d246b67c0f2425d92d9b fix(checkpoint): detect nested git directories with Git\n\n700d16bb1e3b8050f2dbfe91c4c8fd2f89a6ade4 fix(checkpoint): check out only snapshot paths\n\n49a2af0c1d556912d12b834aa7f2022ef63b528c fix(checkpoint): scope nested restore checkout\n\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1834a-d12d-7c43-8f4a-96ee044d0ace","create_time":1793205792.282037}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
