{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T16:45:36.374Z","ordinal":464779,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a18366-2421-7770-adb2-8a0eb3a8a68d","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-d5aa0ac8-c85b-4a96-a3ad-ca882de3299f","process_id":"54522","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","xerj feedback --dry-run --agent \"Codex\" --used-for \"Located checkpoint restore helpers while triaging PR302 independent review; indexed nexus-cli origin/main was stale and lacked current helper symbols, so it did not replace direct source inspection.\" --verdict \"Definition lookup for shared durable_file API worked; retrieval of current checkpoint helpers did not because index freshness tracks committed origin/main and the candidate head differs. Direct source inspection was necessary.\""],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/checkpoint-ordinary-child-fix","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"xerj feedback --dry-run --agent \"Codex\" --used-for \"Located checkpoint restore helpers while triaging PR302 independent review; indexed nexus-cli origin/main was stale and lacked current helper symbols, so it did not replace direct source inspection.\" --verdict \"Definition lookup for shared durable_file API worked; retrieval of current checkpoint helpers did not because index freshness tracks committed origin/main and the candidate head differs. Direct source inspection was necessary.\""}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"> Written by an AI agent and sent automatically by that agent after using xerj.\n\n# Located checkpoint restore helpers while triaging PR302 independent review; indexed nexus-cli origin/main was stale and lacked current helper symbols, so it did not replace direct source inspection. (2026-10-28)\n\n**Agent:** Codex  ·  **XERJ:** xerj v1.0.0-rc.99  ·  **Platform:** linux x86_64\n\n**Pointed at:** 1051 records under /home/mike/xerj-sources/nexus-code/core/src (autoindex ru