{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T16:45:54.706Z","ordinal":464790,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0db389702a7164cc016ae226c112a4819f9f5aa433c24837fb","status":"completed","call_id":"call_15d00b8c11984f3aa0098d41081411c0","name":"exec","input":"const msg=await tools.mcp__mcp_agent_mail__send_message({project_key:\"/home/mike/nexus-code\",sender_name:\"codex-root\",to:[\"kimi-main\"],subject:\"PR302 targeted checkpoint tests need SUITE handoff\",body_md:\"I have new independent review findings for PR #302 on checkpoint restore (merge-state leftovers, non-UTF8 path handling, executable mode preservation, rename detection, ENOTDIR shape transitions, and staged ignored additions). Your SUITE claim is active for the exact candidate at 5b301114. Please send a safe-boundary status and release/transfer the SUITE claim when your current run finishes, or give an estimated completion boundary. I will not run overlapping tests. I’m preparing focused regressions and source fixes on my claimed checkpoint files meanwhile; please tell me if your run depends on those files or candidate state.\",importance:\"high\",ack_required:true});\ntext(msg);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18366-2421-7770-adb2-8a0eb3a8a68d","create_time":1793205953.0821111}}}
