marker detection without invoking Git on untrusted nested config; deadline-bounded FIFO config/external FIFO include regressions. Isolated TypeScript --noEmit and git diff --check PASS; suite not run due active kimi-main SUITE claim. Independent review requested from plan05_readonly_review; awaiting disposition before push.\ndocs/v1.0.0/CONCURRENCY.md:28:    \"$AGENT_NAME\" \"v1/plan-01-pr-1a\" \"$(date -u +%FT%TZ)\" \"$$\" > \"$CLAIMS/$SLICE/owner.json\"\ndocs/v1.0.0/CONCURRENCY.md:30:  echo \"claimed by: $(cat \"$CLAIMS/$SLICE/owner.json\")\"; exit 1\ndocs/v1.0.0/CONCURRENCY.md:36:- **Stale claims.** A claim older than 24 h whose PID is gone may be broken, but only by the owner, or by an agent that first records the broken claim in the log.\ndocs/v1.0.0/CONCURRENCY.md:43:| Source | One `git worktree` per claimed slice: `git worktree add ../nexus-wt/<slice> -b v1/<plan>-<slice> origin/main`. Never edit `~/nexus-code` itself. It is the owner's checkout, and `/usr/local/bin/nexus` runs from it. |\ndocs/v1.0.0/CONCURRENCY.md:87:5. Pushing, tagging, publishing and changing GitHub state (issues, milestones, releases) are **owner-approved actions** (DECISIONS X-list). Agents prepare them and do not perform them.\n.git/nexus-claims/V1_CHECKPOINT_UNTRACKED_INTEGRATION/owner.json:10:  \"status\": \"PR #302 follow-up commit 662d084a pushed against base 145d464. Independent reviewer ACCEPTed the nested-workspace scoped-index delta (SHA-256 61f4e40b); TypeScript and diff checks pass. Exact-head CI 40724201818 and CodeQL 40724202083 are running; no local suite run under active SUITE claim.\",\n.git/nexus-claims/FILE_docs_reviews_evidence_v1-qualification_rc.7_terminal-matrix/owner.json:9:  \"status\": \"Prepared worksheet commit 4e36019 independently accepted. The CSV has 15 pending cells bound to RC7 source and archive digest; no manual checks or screenshots exist. Await current main suite and owner integration path.\",\n.git/nexus-claims/SEC_DEMO_GIT_CLEANUP_RACE/owner.json:1