ory workspace restore. Added scoped index merge and a sibling staged/worktree regression in claimed worktree; diff-check passed. Current TypeScript check unavailable because the worktree has no installed compiler. Active SUITE claim remains kimi-main provider composite focused tests, so no local suite runs.), updated 34 minutes ago\"}]}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18366-2421-7770-adb2-8a0eb3a8a68d","create_time":1793206034.765304}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
