{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T16:55:52.479Z","ordinal":465329,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a18366-2421-7770-adb2-8a0eb3a8a68d","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-a644ca59-34b8-48df-a14b-c50f6bc962fe","process_id":"22350","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","git fetch origin refs/pull/302/head:refs/remotes/origin/pr/302; git show -s --format='%H%n%P%n%an <%ae>%n%ad%n%s' --date=iso-strict refs/remotes/origin/pr/302; git log --oneline --decorate --max-count=8 refs/remotes/origin/pr/302; cat /home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/V1_CHECKPOINT_UNTRACKED_OWNER_PR_20261028/owner.json; tail -n 20 /home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/nexus-claims.log; git status --short --branch"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/checkpoint-ordinary-child-fix","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"git fetch origin refs/pull/302/head:refs/remotes/origin/pr/302; git show -s --format='%H%n%P%n%an <%ae>%n%ad%n%s' --date=iso-strict refs/remotes/origin/pr/302; git log --oneline --decorate --max-count=8 refs/remotes/origin/pr/302; cat /home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/V1_CHECKPOINT_UNTRACKED_OWNER_PR_20261028/owner.json; tail -n 20 /home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/nexus-claims.log; git status --short --branch"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"From https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code\n * [new ref]           refs/pull/302/head -> origin/pr/302\n934ed912b8e187c5c418709e472a6313bb4169a8\n35c81484e34b4710d50ce80cc66e7b3aaa8b5ee1\nMike Holownych <mike@holownych.com>\n2026-10-28T16:47:30+00:00\nfix(checkpoint): probe nested Git state from safe metadata\n934ed912 (HEAD -> v1/checkpoint-ordinary-child-fix, origin/v1/defect-checkpoint-untracked-integration, origin/pr/302) fix(checkpoint): probe nested Git state from safe metadata\n35c81484 fix(checkpoint): reject nested Git markers without probing config\nb9a986ed fix(checkpoint): detect nested git directories with Git\n700d16bb fix(checkpoint): check out only snapshot paths\n49a2af0c (pr/302) fix(checkpoint): scope nested restore checkout\n662d084a fix(checkpoint): preserve sibling index on nested restore\nc3901774 fix(checkpoint): close restore safety findings\n91b59dfe fix(checkpoint): preflight all restore mutation paths\n{\n  \"agent\": \"codex-root\",\n  \"base\": \"145d464dd819a20bf918dfbb4f0176f2c4840a08\",\n  \"branch\": \"v1/defect-checkpoint-untracked-integration\",\n  \"head\": \"934ed912b8e187c5c418709e472a6313bb4169a8\",\n  \"host\": \"mike-dev\",\n  \"scope\": \"PR302 checkpoint restore safety: reject nested repository mutation paths while avoiding ordinary project directories named objects/refs; preserve exact preflight and regressions; no suite runs while SUITE is held.\",\n  \"since\": \"2026-10-28T12:15:00Z\",\n  \"status\": \"PR302 exact head 934ed912b8e187c5c418709e472a6313bb4169a8 uses a bounded regular-file snapshot in a private temp repository for nested Git detection; no Git process reads the untrusted nested config. Deadline-bounded FIFO config and external FIFO include regressions are included. Isolated `npx tsc --noEmit` and `git diff --check` pass. No local tests while kimi-main owns SUITE. Fresh independent review requested on this exact head; exact-head CI is running.\",\n  \"worktree\": \"/home/mike/nexus-wt/checkpoint-ordinary-child-fix\",\n  \"last_updated\": \"2026-10-28T16:48:40Z\",\n  \"diff_sha256\": \"3ce144c3e6675032a8814851128e7c993964de9c395c266dad995a78b03f62ab\",\n  \"independent_review\": {\n    \"disposition\": \"ACCEPT\",\n    \"reviewer\": \"/root/review_pr302\",\n    \"base\": \"REDACTED\",\n    \"head\": \"3c52580ae1da6b7f1282018f4d3702dcb75f8bd7\",\n    \"diff_sha256\": \"d90aeb05a9f5c5d0a35bfa0f597d96cc39a5f6480e22b20094f7523cd4cacdff\",\n    \"findings\": 0,\n    \"tests_run\": false,\n    \"confirmed_at\": \"2026-10-28T14:04:47Z\"\n  },\n  \"followup_review\": {\n    \"reviewer\": \"/root/review_pr302\",\n    \"disposition\": \"CHANGES_REQUIRED\",\n    \"head\": \"0f04bb58a3f4b7ee81ded48b8219983f6c92fba2\",\n    \"finding\": \"preflight checks only cp.untrackedFiles; tracked cp.gitRef path replaced by ignored directory can reach read-tree/checkout-index; tests do not assert index unchanged\",\n    \"tests_run\": false\n  },\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-28T14:03:00Z\",\n  \"remediation\": {\n    \"commit\": \"bb057ca69494084e2fcf37ba559b1077157b311a\",\n    \"files\": [\n      \"cli/src/checkpoint.ts\",\n      \"cli/test/checkpoint_restore.test.ts\"\n    ],\n    \"finding\": \"tracked checkpoint tree blob paths were omitted from restore destination preflight\",\n    \"change\": \"preflight union of manifest untracked paths and non-gitlink blob paths from cp.gitRef before read-tree/checkout-index\",\n    \"regression\": \"ignored descendant canary survives; HEAD and Git index entries asserted unchanged after rejection\",\n    \"verification\": \"git diff --check passed; tests not run because SUITE is actively claimed by kimi-main\",\n    \"review_disposition\": \"PENDING_FRESH_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW\"\n  },\n  \"followup_review_2\": {\n    \"reviewer\": \"/root/review_pr302\",\n    \"disposition\": \"ACCEPT\",\n    \"head\": \"c3aaf60e2822de90df9586db4e2ac74d9c4523b0\",\n    \"base\": \"0f04bb58a3f4b7ee81ded48b8219983f6c92fba2\",\n    \"findings\": [],\n    \"tests_run\": false\n  },\n  \"remediation_round_2\": {\n    \"commit\": \"c3aaf60e2822de90df9586db4e2ac74d9c4523b0\",\n    \"finding_1\": \"tracked-target preview fast path could accept directories containing ignored, nested-repository, or special descendants\",\n    \"fix_1\": \"preview fast path now walks descendants and fails closed on .git entries, ignored descendants, and special filesystem entries\",\n    \"finding_2\": \"ignored-canary test did not create a staged delta after checkpoint\",\n    \"fix_2\": \"ignored/FIFO/nested-repository regressions include staged post-checkpoint delta and assert index and staged content remain unchanged; HEAD and obstruction canaries are preserved\",\n    \"verification\": \"git diff --check passed; tests/builds/probes not run because SUITE is held by kimi-main\",\n    \"review_disposition\": \"PENDING_FRESH_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW\"\n  },\n  \"followup_review_3\": {\n    \"reviewer\": \"agent-53\",\n    \"disposition\": \"CHANGES_REQUIRED\",\n    \"head\": \"3c52580ae1da6b7f1282018f4d3702dcb75f8bd7\",\n    \"finding\": \"bare_config_include_bypass; detection must resolve effective bare state or fail closed\",\n    \"reported_at\": \"2026-10-28T14:05:03Z\"\n  },\n  \"remediation_round_3\": {\n    \"commit\": \"def07ecb\",\n    \"findings\": [\n      \"clean preview can list child paths rather than exact directory and should allow ordinary untracked child replacement\",\n      \"committed child replacement can expose ENOTDIR during post-checkout deletion cleanup\"\n    ],\n    \"changes\": [\n      \"allow nonempty clean previews only when descendants are ordinary nonignored filesystem entries and no tracked descendants exist; tracked descendants continue through the tracked-only validator\",\n      \"treat ENOENT and ENOTDIR during deletion cleanup as already absent paths\"\n    ],\n    \"regressions\": [\n      \"ordinary untracked child restore succeeds\",\n      \"staged and committed child restore test explicitly asserts success without ENOTDIR\",\n      \"ignored canary and nested .git obstruction tests assert staged index/content and HEAD unchanged\"\n    ],\n    \"verification\": \"git diff --check passed; no tests/builds/probes because SUITE remains active under kimi-main\",\n    \"review_disposition\": \"PENDING_FRESH_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW\"\n  },\n  \"remediation_round_4\": {\n    \"commit\": \"d880a388\",\n    \"finding\": \"existing committed-child test checkpointed a as untracked rather than a tracked Git blob\",\n    \"change\": \"added dedicated regression that commits a before checkpoint, then commits a/child and restores the track