{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T17:04:39.549Z","ordinal":465775,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a18366-2421-7770-adb2-8a0eb3a8a68d","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-7e843e1b-eab7-4ebf-94ef-68ec36d3864e","process_id":"36744","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","ssh -o BatchMode=yes mike@10.0.8.3 'cat ~/.cache/nexus-rc9-terminal-matrix/START-HERE.md; echo \"--- files\"; find ~/.cache/nexus-rc9-terminal-matrix -maxdepth 2 -type f -printf \"%M %u:%g %s %p\\n\" | sort'"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"ssh -o BatchMode=yes mike@10.0.8.3 'cat ~/.cache/nexus-rc9-terminal-matrix/START-HERE.md; echo \"--- files\"; find ~/.cache/nexus-rc9-terminal-matrix -maxdepth 2 -type f -printf \"%M %u:%g %s %p\\n\" | sort'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"# Nexus RC9 terminal matrix on ubuntu-desktop\n\nThe exact RC9 package is installed in an isolated prefix; RC6/RC8 and the regular Nexus install were not changed. Terminal scripts come from source commit `4cae11cbc3b0eab9bd6f56df7cc34e946b5dc566` (bundle SHA-256 `70bba2ca0f0208586cf5d2a0275999182fe87b9e0449c50f9f21967813c16294`).\n\nEvidence directory: `~/.local/share/nexus/qualifications/v1.0.0-rc.9/terminal`\n\nRun each command inside the named, real terminal after resizing it to the exact grid. The script verifies the installed package and actual grid, launches the TUI twice, guides checks 1–7, and asks for an operator name and two screenshots. Keep a second terminal open to take screenshots while the cell is paused.\n\n| Terminal | 80×24 | 40×14 | 200×60 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| xterm | `~/.cache/nexus-rc9-terminal-matrix/run-cell xterm 80x24` | `~/.cache/nexus-rc9-terminal-matrix/run-cell xterm 40x14` | `~/.cache/nexus-rc9-terminal-matrix/run-cell xterm 200x60` |\n| kitty (keyboard protocol on) | `~/.cache/nexus-rc9-terminal-matrix/run-cell kitty 80x24` | `~/.cache/nexus-rc9-terminal-matrix/run-cell kitty 40x14` | `~/.cache/nexus-rc9-terminal-matrix/run-cell kitty 200x60` |\n| tmux inside GNOME Terminal | `~/.cache/nexus-rc9-terminal-matrix/run-cell tmux-gnome 80x24` | `~/.cache/nexus-rc9-terminal-matrix/run-cell tmux-gnome 40x14` | `~/.cache/nexus-rc9-terminal-matrix/run-cell tmux-gnome 200x60` |\n| VS Code integrated terminal | `~/.cache/nexus-rc9-terminal-matrix/run-cell vscode 80x24` | `~/.cache/nexus-rc9-terminal-matrix/run-cell vscode 40x14` | `~/.cache/nexus-rc9-terminal-matrix/run-cell vscode 200x60` |\n| GNOME Terminal | `~/.cache/nexus-rc9-terminal-matrix/run-cell gnome 80x24` | `~/.cache/nexus-rc9-terminal-matrix/run-cell gnome 40x14` | `~/.cache/nexus-rc9-terminal-matrix/run-cell gnome 200x60` |\n\nFor each cell, capture the approval panel and the restored terminal after exit. From another desktop shell, use:\n\n`~/.cache/nexus-rc9-terminal-matrix/capture-shot ~/.local/share/nexus/qualifications/v1.0.0-rc.9/terminal/<terminal>-<size>-approval.png`\n\nand replace `approval` with `post-exit` for the second capture. The helper uses the active GNOME screenshot service and prints the hash. Enter both full paths when the runner asks. A desktop screenshot UI is also acceptable. Do not infer PASS: record what you actually observe for every check. Preserve failed and partial attempts.\n\nThe matrix remains unstarted (0/15) until the operator runs these cells. Do not use automated PTY output as a substitute. After completion, run the source `summarize.mjs` with the RC9 installed archive manifest hash and transfer the evidence directory unchanged into the qualification evidence PR.\n--- files\n-rw-rw-r-- mike:mike 13638 /home/mike/.cache/nexus-rc9-terminal-matrix/scripts.tar.gz\n-rw-rw-r-- mike:mike 2719 /home/mike/.cache/nexus-rc9-terminal-matrix/START-HERE.md\n-rwx------ mike:mike 416 /home/mike/.cache/nexus-rc9-terminal-matrix/capture-shot\n-rwx------ mike:mike 472 /home/mike/.cache/nexus-rc9-terminal-matrix/run-cell\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":649752446}},"started_at_ms":1793207078899,"completed_at_ms":1793207079549}}
