{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T17:12:59.562Z","ordinal":466128,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a18366-2421-7770-adb2-8a0eb3a8a68d","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0db389702a7164cc016ae22d1a88cc819f840477844261a82e","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"CI’s three behavioral failures on `934ed912` are now clear: two checkpoint restore regressions and the persistence-policy guard rejecting a raw `fs.writeFileSync` in `checkpoint.ts`. The nested-bare-repository diagnostic has already been corrected in the rebased candidate. I’m fixing the remaining root causes: skip worktree reads for paths whose Git index entry is absent (the path can resolve through a changed symlink parent), and write the private probe `HEAD` through the established atomic helper."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793207578634,"completed_at_ms":1793207579562}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T17:12:59.566Z","ordinal":466129,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","status":"completed","id":"msg_0db389702a7164cc016ae22d1a88cc819f840477844261a82e","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"CI’s three behavioral failures on `934ed912` are now clear: two checkpoint restore regressions and the persistence-policy guard rejecting a raw `fs.writeFileSync` in `checkpoint.ts`. The nested-bare-repository diagnostic has already been corrected in the rebased candidate. I’m fixing the remaining root causes: skip worktree reads for paths whose Git index entry is absent (the path can resolve through a changed symlink parent), and write the private probe `HEAD` through the established atomic helper.","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18366-2421-7770-adb2-8a0eb3a8a68d","create_time":1793207578.5356283,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_0db389702a7164cc016ae22d1a88cc819f840477844261a82e","turn_id":"01a18366-2421-7770-adb2-8a0eb3a8a68d","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a18380-33ae-77c0-a936-ded991ae3fa6","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":22140}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T17:13:02.330Z","ordinal":466130,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0db389702a7164cc016ae22d1b8b18819f9e9d3f68d4726429","status":"completed","call_id":"call_b85ea0760c9743849bb162af1cab7059","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /home/mike/nexus-wt/checkpoint-ordinary-child-fix/cli/src/checkpoint.ts\\n@@\\n     const gitRoot = this.gitRoot();\\n     for (const relativePath of changedPaths) {\\n       if (!allowSensitive) this.assertSnapshotTextSafe(relativePath);\\n+      let indexedEntryFound = false;\\n       try {\\n         const indexEntry = execFileSync(\\\"git\\\", [\\\"-c\\\", \\\"core.fsmonitor=false\\\", \\\"ls-files\\\", \\\"--stage\\\", \\\"--full-name\\\", \\\"-z\\\", \\\"--\\\", `:(top,literal)${relativePath}`], {\\n@@\\n         const entry = indexEntry.split(\\\"\\\\0\\\").find(Boolean);\\n         if (!entry) throw new Error(\\\"Checkpoint could not verify protected Git index state\\\");\\n+        indexedEntryFound = true;\\n         const tab = entry.indexOf(\\\"\\\\t\\\");\\n@@\\n           // Not present in the index: the path may be a staged deletion. Git's\\n-          // checkpoint operation will not persist any untracked replacement.\\n+          // checkpoint operation will not persist any untracked replacement.\\n         }\\n       }\\n+\\n+      // A staged deletion's worktree path may resolve through a changed\\n+      // symlink parent to unrelated content. Its bytes are not part of the\\n+      // indexed checkpoint; untracked replacements are checked separately.\\n+      if (!indexedEntryFound) continue;\\n \\n       const worktreePath = path.join(gitRoot, relativePath);\\n@@\\n-              fs.writeFileSync(path.join(probeRoot, \\\"HEAD\\\"), headSnapshot, { mode: 0o600, flag: \\\"wx\\\" });\\n+              writePrivateFile(path.join(probeRoot, \\\"HEAD\\\"), headSnapshot);\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18366-2421-7770-adb2-8a0eb3a8a68d","create_time":1793207579.5447304}}}
