op 10.0.8.3 reachable over SSH. GUI session active. xterm 407, kitty 0.45.0, GNOME Terminal 3.58.0, tmux 3.6, VS Code 1.143.1 installed. RC10 binary at ~/.local/nexus-rc10-qualification/bin/nexus reports 1.0.0-rc.10 (16ee8ca36438). Opened xterm 80x24 using a disposable workspace as setup only; no manual acceptance evidence collected., review_state=Independent ACCEPT of f8f6983 vs 934ed912, exact diff SHA-256 38425b0e892f4a0741601516b23ca71a768dc4f08ef06955e6f5869ef47d8527, findings 0, tests not run. Review specifically covers staged deletion in assertGitChangesSafe and safe cleanup ordering. A newer uncommitted 10/-2 checkpoint.ts delta was excluded., ci_state=PR302 exact 700d16 CI 40726281681 failed on Node22/24, each 1956 pass / 1 fail / 2 skipped; failing test tracked deletion cleanup runs before a checkpoint symlink can redirect it (checkpoint_restore.test.ts:758), createCheckpoint wrapper at line 922. New remote 934ed912 CI 40729450236 in progress, CodeQL 40729450361 passed., next_checkpoint2=No tests until SUITE handoff from kimi-main., updated 8 minutes ago\\n  - [doing] Address PR #302 review finding for nested bare Git repository ancestors (detail=Exact PR head 3c52580ae1da6b7f1282018f4d3702dcb75f8bd7 is remotely verified and independently ACCEPTED (diff SHA-256 d90aeb05a9f5c5d0a35bfa0f597d96cc39a5f6480e22b20094f7523cd4cacdff). Immutable-snapshot validation: checkpoint_restore 51/51, TypeScript --noEmit PASS, diff-check PASS; isolated HOME and logs retained at /var/tmp/nexus-pr302-3c52580.91oUZ9. CodeQL and JS/TS PASS; Node 22/24 and Entire are pending. PR remains open; no merge.), updated about 3 hours ago\\n  - [doing] Close partial nested bare repository config bypass and requalify PR302 (detail=Independent reviewer ACCEPTed working diff SHA-256 28524ef98877b37c8d385d0ede5cfdf682d620515fab4a135e05212985841484. Committed as 72939ec8da37bc22509c8c87ebaacc5de7724f02 and pushed fast-forward to PR302. Isolated-HOME tsc --noEmit and diff-check pass; no tests run due kimi-main SUITE claim. Exact PR checks 40717946373/40717945285 started; Entire reviewer asked to verify exact pushed content and then record own approval if policy allows. Ubuntu read-only Entire inspection showed zero approvals on trail 17 before current head check., next_checkpoint=Wait for exact-head CI and independent Entire reviewer response; obtain explicit SUITE safe-boundary transfer before targeted/full validation. Use valid "}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18366-2421-7770-adb2-8a0eb3a8a68d","create_time":1793207780.3703344}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
