{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T17:20:12.865Z","ordinal":466459,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a18366-2421-7770-adb2-8a0eb3a8a68d","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-b1deb3d9-016d-4fe2-bc40-4cfba541502d","process_id":"62464","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","entire brain query \"Entire Gates failure PR 305 reviewer approval trail PR 302 exact candidate\" --json; printf '\\n--- PR305 checks + run ---\\n'; gh pr checks 305; gh run list --branch v1/fix-operation-restart-conversation --limit 5 --json databaseId,workflowName,headSha,status,conclusion,createdAt | jq"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"entire brain query \"Entire Gates failure PR 305 reviewer approval trail PR 302 exact candidate\" --json; printf '\\n--- PR305 checks + run ---\\n'; gh pr checks 305; gh run list --branch v1/fix-operation-restart-conversation --limit 5 --json databaseId,workflowName,headSha,status,conclusion,createdAt | jq"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"{\n  \"branch\": \"main\",\n  \"query\": \"Entire Gates failure PR 305 reviewer approval trail PR 302 exact candidate\",\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"source\": \"fact\",\n      \"id\": \"fact:050f2a39d9261b65895c0d5c\",\n      \"path\": \"workflow.review.rules\",\n      \"heading\": \"invariant\",\n      \"text\": \"Release merges require a recorded independent ACCEPT and green CI for the exact PR head; self-acceptance and unrecorded claims of reviewer acceptance do not satisfy the gate.\",\n      \"score\": 0.01639344262295082,\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:43:47Z\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:43:47Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source\": \"fact\",\n      \"id\": \"fact:31acf9d2764c3acd6608ce40\",\n      \"path\": \"project.tooling.stack\",\n      \"heading\": \"closed-negative\",\n      \"text\": \"PR #38 was closed because v1 integration already contained the sharp 0.35.5 security fix, while its bundled Cloudflare cf beta.10-to-beta.18 upgrade was unnecessary and untested in v1; revisit cf through a fresh post-release Dependabot PR or PLAN-C1 hardening.\",\n      \"score\": 0.016129032258064516,\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:43:47Z\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:43:47Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source\": \"fact\",\n      \"id\": \"fact:d03646b7f483da70cf518747\",\n      \"path\": \"workflow.release.acceptance\",\n      \"heading\": \"invariant\",\n      \"text\": \"Green CI and independent code review do not constitute qualification or release acceptance; source may merge for RC construction, but publication requires all acceptance gates and evidence tied to the actual candidate.\",\n      \"score\": 0.015873015873015872,\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:50:18Z\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:50:18Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source\": \"fact\",\n      \"id\": \"fact:e7f00f83dda26737693392e1\",\n      \"path\": \"architecture.boundaries.rationale\",\n      \"heading\": \"closed-negative\",\n      \"text\": \"Timing delays and repeated Enter presses were rejected as sufficient protection for session-wide approval: independent PTY reviews repeatedly reached auto mode through ordinary composer editing keys despite longer waits; revisit only with a decision key distinct from composer editing, and keep approve-all unreachable through arrow selection.\",\n      \"score\": 0.015625,\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:43:47Z\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:43:47Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source\": \"fact\",\n      \"id\": \"fact:6f468c3f9da62a2b8548eb53\",\n      \"path\": \"workflow.branching.rules\",\n      \"heading\": \"convention\",\n      \"text\": \"Before authorizing the objective-supervisor spike, independently review commits 6f71043, 6845415 and 6b34f5f after reviewed base 1b71e27 to establish an acceptable I0 development base; the reviewer should not have authored or advocated for the candidate.\",\n      \"score\": 0.015384615384615385,\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:43:47Z\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:43:47Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source\": \"fact\",\n      \"id\": \"fact:8a594d0e92c29b347b3994b9\",\n      \"path\": \"architecture.routing.evaluation\",\n      \"heading\": \"closed-negative\",\n      \"text\": \"The frozen 11-task comparison did not establish a benefit for first-turn-heavy deep-planner/lead-coder routing: B1 passed 7/11, B2 passed 6/11, exact paired sign-test p=1.0, and B2 took about 21% longer; preserve this bounded finding and revisit only with a larger corpus and a substantive hypothesis about which tasks need deeper planning.\",\n      \"score\": 0.015151515151515152,\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:43:47Z\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:43:47Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source\": \"fact\",\n      \"id\": \"fact:52d9282dd9bd6f5338da4cf4\",\n      \"path\": \"workflow.review.rules\",\n      \"heading\": \"convention\",\n      \"text\": \"Independent ACCEPTs must identify the exact full commit SHA; after a rebase, approval may carry forward only after stable patch IDs confirm the reviewed change is identical, and merging still requires green CI on the new exact head.\",\n      \"score\": 0.014925373134328358,\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:43:47Z\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:43:47Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source\": \"fact\",\n      \"id\": \"fact:db2c60684166bcd2018f32c3\",\n      \"path\": \"workflow.testing.rules\",\n      \"heading\": \"invariant\",\n      \"text\": \"Release-candidate validation must cover the exact source commit being tagged; any integration-head change, including a docs-only merge, requires fresh source CI and a new requirements --enforce run.\",\n      \"score\": 0.014705882352941176,\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:43:47Z\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:43:47Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source\": \"fact\",\n      \"id\": \"fact:9d1ee1a80b98584a8f3fb311\",\n      \"path\": \"workflow.branching.rules\",\n      \"heading\": \"invariant\",\n      \"text\": \"For v1.0.0 work, an agent may merge its own PR only after independent ACCEPT and green CI on the exact head; agents must never self-accept.\",\n      \"score\": 0.014492753623188406,\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:43:47Z\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:43:47Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source\": \"fact\",\n      \"id\": \"fact:44759bbdf6cea50f52c538b3\",\n      \"path\": \"workflow.branching.rules\",\n      \"heading\": \"convention\",\n      \"text\": \"Release-lane agents may merge their own PRs only after independent ACCEPT and green CI for the exact head; contributing code to a combined candidate disqualifies an agent from independently accepting it.\",\n      \"score\": 0.014285714285714285,\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:43:47Z\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:43:47Z\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\n--- PR305 checks + run ---\nEntire Gates\tfail\t42m24s\thttps://entire.com/gh/mikeholownych/-/trails/20/changes/nexus-code/20\t\nCodeQL\tpass\t3s\thttps://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/runs/122932271241\t\nCodeRabbit\tpass\t0\t\tReview skipped\njavascript-typescript\tpass\t1m27s\thttps://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40720990566/job/122931500843\t\nlinux-x86_64\tpass\t23m34s\thttps://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40720990441/job/122941048726\t\ntest-matrix (22)\tpass\t16m6s\thttps://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40720990441/job/122931501136\t\ntest-matrix (24)\tpass\t14m42s\thttps://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40720990441/job/122931500476\t\n[\n  {\n    \"conclusion\": \"success\",\n    \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-28T15:56:20Z\",\n    \"databaseId\": 40720990441,\n    \"headSha\": \"f0f4847af188f0bf029e018cc8147ddd94a06904\",\n    \"status\": \"completed\",\n    \"workflowName\": \"CI\"\n  },\n  {\n  