{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T17:23:28.358Z","ordinal":466635,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a18389-cbe6-7690-a290-4bbcc0eafa28","author":"/root/review_pr302","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/review_pr302\nPayload:\n**ACCEPT** — reviewed base `8580c821f57119768db01614d31cd60e8766468b` to head `fde0b7b98fc1bde15db3bc4a0afbe85e5ccf8d8f`. Combined diff SHA-256 matches: `10fb513891f7f98be7c0fe6d89e5bf1b9eb9f6348cf4ca8390a0b5fb5b7e6d83`.\n\nThe range-diff confirms the three PR commits are patch-identical to the previously accepted versions. The restart branch resets conversation history only for an explicitly authorized restart with otherwise usable recovery state, starts from the fresh task prompt with `resume: false`, and keeps verification obligations intact. No tests were run."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18366-2421-7770-adb2-8a0eb3a8a68d","create_time":1793208208.358181,"content_item_metadata":[{"provenance":{"type":"tool","namespace":"collaboration"}}]}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":22157}}
