15, #17, and #20). The reviewer who accepted #302 and #305 cannot access the approval system from this host.\n\nAcceptance remains **IN_PROGRESS**. RC10 is still the latest public prerelease; held-out qualification, manual terminal evidence, and other exact-RC gates remain open. No RC or release is being declared accepted.\n\n","started_at":1793205871,"completed_at":1793208568,"duration_ms":2697247,"time_to_first_token_ms":3915}}
